//SAM DAILY DIALOGUE
	//0 hearts
		"sam.daily.Thu": "I was wondering, do you like music? Play any instruments?#$b#... Oh a hand harp, cool! You should come by sometime, we could jam together.$h#$b#Hm... can a harp jam? Only one way to find out... and I'll show you some riffs on the guitar, I can play drums too, but I prefer the 6-string.$h",
		"sam.daily.Fri": "It's Friday! Yeah! Time for hanging out at the saloon and playing pool.$h#$b#You should come too!#$b#Me, Seb, Abigail, and a few others are regulars on Friday nights, like a tradition or something. It would be great to have a new person join!$h#$b#And uh... if you want to play a round on one of the arcade games, I'm happy to play with you.",
		"sam.daily.summer_Mon": "Phew!! It gets pretty damn hot here in the summer, but at least my allergies have calmed down.#$b#Have you been down to the beach yet? The breeze off the ocean feels great and there's some tide pools if you can get to them.#$b#Vincent really loves those... maybe I'll see you there? I can show you the different creatures and corals. It's pretty cool.$h",
	//2 hearts
		"sam.daily.Mon2.1": "Hi @! Feel free to come in my room whenever you want, I don't mind at all.#$b#It's kinda messy, so you'll have to ignore the clothes and stuff. Don't worry, there's nothing weird in there, except maybe some conspiracy magazines.#$b#I try to clean it up, but for some reason it always gets messy again right away. *shrugs*$h",
		"sam.daily.Mon2.2": "Hi @, how's the farm thing going?#$b#Be sure to take breaks from work, y'know? If you ever get bored, come find me!$h#$b#We could... listen to music, hang out at the beach, swing at the park, I'm sure we could come up with something to do.$h",
		"sam.daily.Tue2.1.first": "I've been working on learning some street magic tricks to show Vincent, can I practice on you?$h#$b#Cool! Okay, here goes. See, my hands are empty...#$b#%Sam holds out his hands, then reaches behind my ear and pretends to pull out a guitar pick, his fingers brushing my hair.#$b#Look, a guitar pick! Haha! I actually did it without dropping the pick this time, I'm getting better at this!$h#$b#%His teeth flash in a grin, blue-green eyes glinting. My ear still tingles from his touch, I wonder if he noticed...",
		"sam.daily.Tue2.1.third": "I've been working on learning some street magic tricks to show Vincent, can I practice on you?$h#$b#Cool! Okay, here goes. See, my hands are empty...#$b#%Sam holds out his hands, then reaches behind @'s ear and pretends to pull out a guitar pick.#$b#Look! A guitar pick! Haha! I actually did it without dropping the pick this time, I'm getting better at this!$h#$b#%His teeth flash in a grin, blue-green eyes glinting. @'s ear still tingles from his touch...",
		"sam.daily.Tue2.2": "I've been playing guitar since I was a little kid, my dad taught me, then I learned by watching videos and stuff.#$b#Your mom taught you the hand harp? That's great! My mom used to write poems, I remember her reading some to us before Dad left for the war... I miss that.$s",
		"sam.daily.Wed2.1": "I keep bugging Seb to play arcade or console games with me, but he isn't great at those kinds of games so he gets all sulky about it.#$b#$y 'Do you like video games?_Sure! I like action games._Awesome! Next time I'm headed to the saloon, you can join me and we'll play a few PvP rounds of Prairie King, you can show me your moves!$h_I'm not great at those either..._That's okay, if you want to try I can show you some tricks that make it easier, I don't mind at all.$h'",
		"sam.daily.Wed2.2.first": "*mutters* Mom, I’m a grown man... sheesh, a grown-ass man!$a#$b#OH! @, I didn’t see you there, sorry I was kinda on a rant.#$b#It’s tough still living with your parents as an adult, but it’s also hard to make enough money to live on your own.$s#$b#*sighs* Gets really frustrating sometimes y’know?$s#$b#%Pfft... grown-ass man? Erm... well, he does have a fine ass...#$b#Heh, I guess that must have sounded pretty dumb, sorry about that...$s#$b#Wait, did you say something about... nah, I must've been hearing things.$10",
		"sam.daily.Wed2.2.third": "*mutters* Mom, I’m a grown man... sheesh, a grown-ass man!$a#$b#OH! @, I didn’t see you there, sorry I was kinda on a rant.#$b#It’s tough still living with your parents as an adult, but it’s also hard to make enough money to live on your own.$s#$b#*sighs* Gets really frustrating sometimes y’know?$s#$b#%@ chuckles... grown-ass man? Erm... well, he does have a fine ass...#$b#Heh, I guess that must have sounded pretty dumb, sorry about that...$s#$b#Wait, did you say something about... nah, I must've been hearing things.$10",
		"sam.daily.Thu2.1": "Hey, I got an extra Joja cola from work, here ya go![167]$h#$b#What’s up today? I’m working on some new tricks on the skateboard.#$b#Would be way easier if we had a skatepark, but I can make do with the planters and stuff around here as long as our fine mayor doesn't catch me...$a#$h#I swear that guy has it in for me. Accidentally take out one of his precious flowers, and he holds a grudge for life.$s",
		"sam.daily.Thu2.2": "*elbow nudge* Seb was sounding kinda down earlier so I’m headed over to hang with him.#$b#Want to come with? He'll let you read his comics if you want.$h#$b#He’s a good guy, just really quiet. We've been friends forever, he's really into Solarion Chronicles if you've ever played. You should join us sometime!$h",
		"sam.daily.Fri2.1.first": "*fist bump* @! Coming to the saloon tonight?$h#$b#I bet Seb would let you play a round of pool, have you played before?#$b#I could show you the ropes, or Seb could too I guess.#$b#Oh yeah, Abigail mentioned she liked talking with you, she gets kinda bored I think.#$b#%It might be fun to let Sam show me how to play pool, he's always so positive and cheerful... but he's nice to everyone.",
		"sam.daily.Fri2.1.third": "*fist bump* @! Coming to the saloon tonight?$h#$b#I bet Seb would let you play a round of pool, have you played before?#$b#I could show you the ropes, or Seb could too I guess.#$b#Oh yeah, Abigail mentioned she liked talking with you, she gets kinda bored I think.#$b#%@ considers... it might be fun to let Sam demonstrate how to play pool, he's always so positive and cheerful... but he's nice to everyone.",
		"sam.daily.Fri2.2.first": "*fist bump* what’s up? Will you be at the saloon tonight?#$b#Seb always wipes the floor with me at pool, but it’s fun hanging out with friends.#$b#Hope to see you there! *grins*$h#$b#%Sam's smile is a little crooked. Dammit... why's he so cute?",
		"sam.daily.Fri2.2.third": "*fist bump* what’s up? Will you be at the saloon tonight?#$b#Seb always wipes the floor with me at pool, but it’s fun hanging out with friends.#$b#Hope to see you there! *grins*$h#$b#%@ notices Sam's smile is a little crooked. Dammit... why's he so cute?",
		"sam.daily.Sat2.1.first": "%Huh... I wonder... before he can move, I reach up and press down Sam's spiky hair. It's soft and bouncy...#$b#Hey! No, no, don’t do that, my hair is like my personal brand!#$b#Pfft, just kidding, it just does that by itself, like a million cowlicks and I can’t get it to lay down to save my life, haha!$h#$b#Plus it makes me look taller, not that I need help with that anymore. I kinda shot up a couple years ago.#$b#Oh that reminds me, I haven’t teased Seb about being shorter than me in a while, hmmm.",
		"sam.daily.Sat2.1.third": "%@ reaches out to press down Sam's spiky hair... it's soft and bouncy...#$b#Hey! No, no, don’t do that! My hair is like my personal brand!#$b#Pfft, just kidding, it just does that by itself, like a million cowlicks and I can’t get it to lay down to save my life, haha!$h#$b#Plus it makes me look taller, not that I need help with that anymore. I kinda shot up a couple years ago.#$b#Oh that reminds me, I haven’t teased Seb about being shorter than me in a while, hmmm.",
		"sam.daily.Sat2.2.first": "We've run into each other like, every day this week!#$b#I might start thinking you like me, haha!$h#$b#Just kidding! Well, mostly anyway. The farm life must be treating you well... you look really great.$l#$b#Come hang with me and Seb whenever, we're usually at the saloon on Fridays and my house on Saturdays, you're always welcome.$h#$b#%I turn to walk away, then glance back at Sam and he flashes a grin... my heart does weird gymnastics... *Sigh*",
		"sam.daily.Sat2.2.third": "We've run into each other like, every day this week!#$b#I might start thinking you like me, haha!$h#$b#Just kidding! Well, mostly anyway. The farm life must be treating you well... you look really great.$l#$b#Come hang with me and Seb whenever, we're usually at the saloon on Fridays and my house on Saturdays, you're always welcome.$h#$b#%@ turns to walk away, then glances back at Sam and he flashes a heart-melting grin...",
		"sam.daily.Sun2.1.first": "How's the mining going? Damn, that's a nasty cut on your hand... *gulps* Are you sure you're okay?$s#$b#Uh, I'm not great with blood and stuff, but Seb has a first aid kit so you should have him wrap that for you.#$b#He's actually really great at that kind of thing if you ever need a quick patching up and don't want to see Harvey.#$b#I guess it's useful living with a carpenter, plus being close to the mines...#$b#%Sam keeps glancing away, then back at my hand. He really is squeamish! Maybe I should get it wrapped up.",
		"sam.daily.Sun2.1.third": "How's the mining going? Damn, that's a nasty cut on your hand... *gulps* Are you sure you're okay?$s#$b#Uh, I'm not great with blood and stuff, but Seb has a first aid kit so you should have him wrap that for you.#$b#He's actually really great at that kind of thing if you ever need a quick patching up and don't want to see Harvey.#$b#I guess it's useful living with a carpenter, plus being close to the mines...#$b#%Sam keeps glancing away, then back at @'s hand. He really is squeamish!",
		"sam.daily.Sun2.2.first": "Hi! Want some coffee? I already had THREE CUPS today and Seb gave me another one.[253]$h#$b#I would drink it cuz he makes great coffee but I’m already WAY too wired, HAHA! Oh, sorry! That was loud.$h#$b#I better go skateboarding or take a jog or something or I’ll NEVER get to sleep tonight!#$b#%Sam is bouncing up and down on his toes, I could give him plenty of chores on the farm, it would be nice watching him work... Oh, heh... I should stop staring and get going.",
		"sam.daily.Sun2.2.third": "Hi! Want some coffee? I already had THREE CUPS today and Seb gave me another one.[253]$h#$b#I would drink it cuz he makes great coffee but I’m already WAY too wired, HAHA! Oh, sorry! That was loud.$h#$b#I better go skateboarding or take a jog or something or I’ll NEVER get to sleep tonight!#$b#%Sam is bouncing up and down on his toes, @ can think of plenty of chores he could do on the farm, it might be nice watching him work...",
	//4 Hearts
		"sam.daily.Mon4.female.first": "%Sam is rubbing the fingers on his left hand and frowning.#$b#Man, it sucks that playing guitar gives my hand these gnarly callouses.#$b#Makes my fingers rough so I bet it feels weird if I touch- heh! Yeah.$s#$b#%I look at my own hands, turning them over, I've gotten a lot of callouses from farm work. Huh?! Sam takes my hands, rubbing his thumbs over my fingers.#$b#%He has the hands of a musician, lean and strong, long fingers gently wrapping around mine... butterflies try to escape my throat...#$b#%Heat creeps up my neck, my hands aren't what most would expect of a woman. But... he smiles, seemingly unconcerned that my hands aren't soft.#$b#%As he starts to release my fingers, I catch his, squeezing them tight. His eyes widen as a gasp escapes his lips...#$b#I kinda didn’t realize you’d have callouses too. I guess that’s something we have in common.$h#$b#I’m glad they don’t bother you, um... they definitely don't bother me.$l",
