		"sam.daily.Wed4": "Hmm... I need to get more guitar picks, I keep losing them.$s#$b#Wonder where they go? Probably the same place as my socks.$h#$b#Next time I go to the music supply store in Zuzu City, wanna come?#$b#There's lots of cool stuff to look at even if you're not super into music, and I'll get you a coffee or whatever you like. Maybe make it a da- uh, never mind.$l",
		"sam.daily.Thu4.1.first": "%Sam catches my hand and presses a chunk of ore into my palm...[384 386]#$b#Found this in the mine by Seb’s. We were in there looking for frozen tears for some project or other he's working on.#$b#I thought you could use it since you go mining a lot... what’s it like down there?#$b#I only go down a few levels with Seb, it gets pretty creepy and I’m really not THAT into rocks!$s#$b#%Sam's cheeks flush as he realizes he's still holding my hand and quickly releases it... I glance down, wishing he had held on a moment longer...",
		"sam.daily.Thu4.1.third": "%Sam catches @'s hand and presses a chunk of ore into it...[384 386]#$b#Found this in the mine by Seb’s. We were in there looking for frozen tears for some project or other he's working on.#$b#I thought you could use it since you go mining a lot... what’s it like down there?#$b#I only go down a few levels with Seb, it gets pretty creepy and I’m really not THAT into rocks!$s#$b#%Sam's cheeks flush as he realizes he's still holding @'s hand and quickly releases it...",
		"sam.daily.Thu4.2.first": "@! Alex mentioned he thought you were good looking...#$b#Um, you don’t LIKE him, like him, do you?$s#$b#... Oh good. Scared me for a sec... he's got all those muscles and would be tough competition...#$b#... Why? OH! Just... reasons.$h#$b#Me? Blushing?? Nah, you must be seeing things...$l#$b#%Grinning, I press the backs of my fingers to his warm cheek, he smiles softly as he glances away.",
		"sam.daily.Thu4.2.third": "@! Alex mentioned he thought you were good looking...#$b#Um, you don’t LIKE him, like him, do you?$s#$b#... Oh good. Scared me for a sec... he's got all those muscles and would be tough competition...#$b#... Why? OH! Just... reasons.$h#$b#Me? Blushing?? Nah, you must be seeing things...$l#$b#%Grinning, @ presses a hand to his warm cheek, he smiles softly as he glances away.",
		"sam.daily.Fri4.first": "Seb mentioned that sci-fi show you guys have been watching, so I tried a few episodes.#$b#It's good, actually! Uh, you mind if I join you and Seb to watch the next one?#$b#%Oh? Is someone feeling a little jealous? I smirk, then tilt my head... if he feels that way, why doesn't he...#$b#Oh heck, no, I'm not jealous... pfft, why would I be...?$l#$b#I mean, I'm sure there's room on the couch, I can take the middle.$h",
		"sam.daily.Fri4.third": "Seb mentioned that sci-fi show you guys have been watching, so I tried a few episodes.#$b#It's good, actually! Uh, you mind if I join you and Seb to watch the next one?#$b#%@ smirks, it seems Sam is a little jealous... if he feels that way, why doesn't he...#$b#Oh heck, no, I'm not jealous... pfft, why would I be...?$l#$b#I mean, I'm sure there's room on the couch, I can take the middle.$h",
		"sam.daily.summer_Tue4.first": "What's up, @? Wanna grab some ice cream at the stand? On me!$h#$b#It's fun to bug Alex, we can see who else is hanging over there.#$b#Maybe head to the beach and play some volleyball? We can do one-on-one if nobody else wants to join.$h#$b#%Beach? Volleyball? Sam in swimtrunks... I bet he has amazing legs and abs from all that skating... not to mention his ass... Uh, I probably should stop staring...",
		"sam.daily.summer_Tue4.third": "What's up, @? Wanna grab some ice cream at the stand? On me!$h#$b#It's fun to bug Alex, we can see who else is hanging over there.#$b#Maybe head to the beach and play some volleyball? We can do one-on-one if nobody else wants to join.$h#$b#%Beach? Volleyball? Sam in swim trunks... he probably has amazing legs and abs from all that skating... not to mention his ass... @ blinks, then glances away, grinning...",
		"sam.daily.summer_Wed4.female": "Hey gorgeous! You're really rockin' that outfit today!$h#$b#I'm taking Vince down to the beach, come join us if you have time.#$b#Vince really loves it when you play in the sand with him.#$b#I like hanging with you too, I'd... love to see you there.$l",
		"sam.daily.summer_Wed4.male": "Hey man! You're really rockin' that outfit today!$h#$b#I'm taking Vince down to the beach, come join us if you have time.#$b#Vince really loves it when you play in the sand with him.#$b#I like hanging with you too, I'd... love to see you there.$l",
		"sam.daily.summer_Wed4.neutral": "Yo! You're really rockin' that outfit today!$h#$b#I'm taking Vince down to the beach, come join us if you have time.#$b#Vince really loves it when you play in the sand with him.#$b#I like hanging with you too, I'd... love to see you there.$l",
		"sam.daily.summer_Sat4.first": "%Sam looks wiped out, he shuffles over... Oh, um... hello... he plunks his head on my shoulder...#$b#Man, I'm tired! Stayed up past 2 last night working on a new song. Hate to quit when I have a good thing going, but *yawns* sure am paying for it today!$s#$b#I'll be useless today, but maybe tomorrow you can stop by and I'll play it for you.#$b#%I suddenly realize my arms are around him, clasping his bare back where his shirt rode up... the muscles along his spine ripple as he straightens.#$b#Oh! I'm sorry... that was sort of... Seb says I have no concept of personal space. Maybe he's right. I hope I didn't make you uncomfortable.$s#$b#Not that I didn't like you holding me- uh... well, crap. I don't think I can save this one...$10",
		"sam.daily.summer_Sat4.third": "%Sam looks wiped out, he shuffles over... plunking his head on @'s shoulder...#$b#Man, I'm tired! Stayed up past 2 last night working on a new song. Hate to quit when I have a good thing going, but *yawns* sure am paying for it today!$s#$b#I'll be useless today, but maybe tomorrow you can stop by and I'll play it for you.#$b#%Suddenly, @'s arms are around him, clasping his bare back where his shirt rode up... the muscles along his spine ripple as he straightens.#$b#Oh! I'm sorry... that was sort of... Seb says I have no concept of personal space. Maybe he's right. I hope I didn't make you uncomfortable.$s#$b#Not that I didn't like you holding me- uh... well, crap. I don't think I can save this one...$10",
		"sam.daily.summer_Sun4": "I’m heading to the beach today, will you be going? Gotta take advantage of the summer while it lasts!#$b#We could collect some shells, walk along the water and watch the waves, see what's hanging out in the tide pools...$h#$b#%A walk with Sam at the beach... that sounds rather romantic...",
	//6 Hearts
		"sam.daily.Mon6.1.female.first": "Oh man, my fingers are sore! I've been trying out some new riffs on my guitar and my fingers aren't used to it yet.$s#$b#%I take Sam's hand and press his fingers against my lips... OH! This is awkward...#$b#... *whispers* @... I... you're so...$l#$b#%He lightly traces my lips before he drops his hand.#$b#Um, I think my fingers feel better now... but they might be sore again tomorrow...$10",
