		"sam.daily.spring_25.first": "Thanks for hanging with me and Seb at the dance!#$b#You looked awesome by the way, though I probably already told you that, haha!$10#$b#It's great having someone new to talk to, makes the same old festivals way more fun.$h#$b#%He grins, shoving his hands in his pockets... OH! Uh, heh! I tear my eyes away from his crotch... Sam IS a decent dancer, and he looked great in that suit... it really highlighted his assets.",
