		"sam.daily.summer_3": "Sheesh, Seb's annual checkup is tomorrow and he always spends the entire day complaining...#$b#I mean, sure it's a pain and there's WAY better things to do than go to the doctor, but it IS only once a year.#$b#Of course, that's easy for me to say, my appointment isn't until fall. Um... if you're free, want to go get ice cream or something?$h",
		"sam.daily.summer_5.first": "@! You gonna be at the saloon tonight? I'll play a game with Seb, then I'll be watching the martial arts fights.#$b#My favorite fighter is on the ticket tonight, Lone Wolf Luca! You'd never guess it if you saw him, but he's savage in the ring.#$b#And he's a musician too, tears it up on the drums! I'd really love to meet him someday.$h#$b#%Wow, Luca sure has a loyal fan! Sam demonstrates a few punches, his biceps flexing... maybe I'll watch the fight and see how good this Luca guy really is...",
		"sam.daily.summer_5.third": "@! You gonna be at the saloon tonight? I'll play a game with Seb, then I'll be watching the martial arts fights.#$b#My favorite fighter is on the ticket tonight, Lone Wolf Luca! You'd never guess it if you saw him, but he's savage in the ring.#$b#And he's a musician too, tears it up on the drums! I'd really love to meet him someday.$h#$b#%Luca sure has a loyal fan! Sam demonstrates a few punches, his biceps flexing... @ decides to watch the fight and see how good this Luca guy really is...",
		"sam.daily.summer_9.first": "The annual Mystery Soup event is coming up... every year I try to think of something really crazy to put in the pot.$h#$b#Mayor Lewis got wise to me last time though, Seb said Lewis asked him to keep me away from the soup this year.$s#$b#... BUT what if you kinda snuck an ingredient in there for me?$h#$b#... Oh all right, I guess you have to keep your reputation up for a while anyway. If you change your mind though...$h#$b#%Sam's eyes glint with mischief, it could be fun to go along with his plan.#$b#%Hmmm he might be trouble... Chuckling, I nudge him with my elbow, and he nudges back.#$b#We can walk over to the tide pools if you want, there's a lot of cool things we could find there.$l",
		"sam.daily.summer_9.third": "The annual Mystery Soup event is coming up... every year I try to think of something really crazy to put in the pot.$h#$b#Mayor Lewis got wise to me last time though, Seb said Lewis asked him to keep me away from the soup this year.$s#$b#... BUT what if you kinda snuck an ingredient in there for me?$h#$b#... Oh all right, I guess you have to keep your reputation up for a while anyway. If you change your mind though...$h#$b#%Sam's eyes glint with mischief, it could be fun to go along with his plan.#$b#%He might be trouble... Chuckling, @ nudges him and he nudges back.#$b#We can walk over to the tide pools if you want, there's a lot of cool things we could find there.$l",
		"sam.daily.summer_10.first": "Today's Maru's birthday so Seb is going to be busy at home... do you wanna hang with me?$l#$b#I've been working on a couple of new songs, I could play them for you and see what you think? Maybe give you some guitar lessons...?$h#$b#It would be fun to do something together, just the two of us... um... maybe like a date? Or not, heheh...$l#$b#%Sam runs his fingers through his hair, that was... kind of distracting... wait, did he ask me out or not?",
		"sam.daily.summer_10.third": "Today's Maru's birthday so Seb is going to be busy at home... do you wanna hang with me?$l#$b#I've been working on a couple of new songs, I could play them for you and see what you think? Maybe give you some guitar lessons...?$h#$b#It would be fun to do something together, just the two of us... um... maybe like a date? Or not, heheh...$l#$b#%Sam runs his fingers through his hair, @ is a little distracted... wait, did he say he wanted to go out or not?",
