		"sam.daily.summer_28.dating.first": "Um, you're coming to see the Glowing Gelatin show tonight, right?$l#$b#It's one of the nicest festivals I think, not a lot to do but the jellies are really cool to watch.$h#$b#We could watch them together, I bet that weird glow off the water will look really amazing lighting up your face.$l#$b#Maybe we could... make out a little? Or as much as you want?$l#$b#%Sam runs his fingers through my hair and grins. I have to admit I'd like to see what he looks like in the glow off the water too.",
