		"sam.daily.fall_23.first": "Check it out! My new shoes finally got here and they feel great!$h#$b#%Sam hops up and down a few times, then does a handstand, his shirt riding up showing his belly and rather well-defined abs. He quickly hops back to his feet, yanking his shirt down.#$b#Oh dang, that's cold! Heh, guess I shouldn't show off like that.$10#$b#Anyway, these shoes will take a few days to break in, I'll wear them this weekend in the haunted maze. You're coming, right?$h#$b#%I blink... Sam asked me something... all that skating he does sure has some great benefits...",
