		"sam.daily.winter_7.dating": "*elbow nudge* Tomorrow is the Snow War Showdown, and that means the annual epic snowball battle is almost upon us!#$b#Seb and I are meeting up to build a barricade so everything is ready. You'll be on my team, right?$h#$b#Seb recruited Alex and I think Abby too. We might need another person, hmmm... who has a good arm... maybe Shane? Dude did play gridball in high school.$h#$b#It's also the perfect time to get Seb back for all the times he's clobbered me at pool... I'm thinking a snowball to the back of the neck!$h#$b#And if you get cold, you can snuggle up with me. It's a great excuse to be all cozy... maybe you can take me to your place and warm me up afterwards...?$10#$b#Drink some hot chocolate by the fireplace... under a blanket... do you want to warm up now?$l",
