		"sam.rain.dating.female.Lover.3": "I used to think rain sucked since I couldn't do much outside, but I really look forward to it now.#$b#... Well, because every time we meet in the rain, you're all wet and cold with your shirt clinging to your smokin' hot breasts...#$b#I selflessly offer to warm you up, and we end up all sweaty and happy in one of our beds... preferably yours...$l#$b#Uh, that was kinda...$10#$b#Anyway, it's kind of like a rainy day tradition, right? Let's not break it today!$l",
