//SAM FESTIVAL DIALOGUE
		"sam.festival.spring13.y1": "*ACHOO!!* Oh man, I'm dying...$s#$b#if I don't make it, please bury me with my guitar, okay?$s#$b#Maybe I'll live long enough to hunt some eggs... wanna join me? I'm not very good, but the offer stands... *SNORF!*$l",
		"sam.festival.spring13.y2.single": "ACHOO!... AAAACHOO!!!...$8#$b#*groans* Ugh, every year I hope my allergies will get better but nope, the universe continues to conspire against me.$s#$b#Wanna team up for the egg hunt? I won't be a lot of help, but it'll be fun to run around together.$h",
		"sam.festival.spring13.y2.dating": "ACHOO!... AAAACHOO!!!...$8#$b#*groans* Ugh, every year I hope my allergies will get better but nope, the universe continues to conspire against me.$s#$b#Wanna team up for the egg hunt? I won't be a lot of help, but it'll be fun to run around together. I'd hold your hand but... *SNORF!*$l",
		"sam.festival.spring13.spouse": "*sniff... sniff* That allergy medicine Harvey gave me seems to be helping some...#$b#Oh no... here it comes... *ACHOO!!*$s#$b#Well, I guess it was too much to hope for. You look so good, I wanna kiss you but I might just sneeze all over you instead...$s#$b#%Awww, poor Sammy... he at least deserves a hug and maybe a little lower back massage...",
		"sam.festival.spring24.y1": "Hey @! This dance thing is kinda lame, are you sure you wanna try it?#$b#Hold on a sec... uh oh... *ACHOO!! ACHOO!! AAAACHOO!!*$8#$b#*SNORF* Oh man, so sorry... ugh... no wonder I'm in the corner.$s",
		"sam.festival.spring24.y2.single": "*SNORF* ooof... I'm good. Did you uh... do you wanna dance?$l#$b#We should take over this party and play some real music... wonder what ol' Lewis would say to that?$h",
		"sam.festival.spring24.y2.dating": "*SNORF* ooof... I'm good. Ready to get down with our bad selves and dance? Haha!$h#$b#We should take over this party and play some real music. Of course, if I was playing I wouldn't be able to dance with you... that's a dilemma!$l",
		"sam.festival.spring24.spouse.y2.first": "*SNORF* Ugh, you have any tissues? Ah, thanks, you're the best!$h#$b#%Sam wraps his arms around me, then slides his hands down to my hips, pulling me close and swaying back and forth.#$b#Maybe we should spice up this dance, give everyone a big surprise!$l",
		"sam.festival.spring24.spouse.y2.third": "*SNORF* Ugh, you have any tissues? Ah, thanks, you're the best!$h#$b#%Sam wraps his arms around @, then slides his hands down... pulling me close and swaying back and forth.#$b#Maybe we should spice up this dance, give everyone a big surprise!$l",
		"sam.festival.summer11.y1": "The Mayor told me to stay away from the soup pot. It's like he doesn't trust me or something, ha!$h#$b#He even recruited Seb to keep me away... I bet we could come up with a plan to get around both of them, you in?#$b#%Sam looks around, then pulls a bag out from under his shirt... How was he hiding that??#$b#I have this giant bag of gummy worms... cover for me, okay?$h#$b#%Pfftt... he sneaks around a corner, crouching with his fine rear sticking out...",
		"sam.festival.summer11.y2": "After the epic failure of Mission Gummy Worm last year, I've come up with something easier to sneak in.$h#$b#This little bottle of Hellfire Incineration Sauce. Just a few drops is enough to fire up the entire pot!$h#$b#I got it from Shane, he lives for the heat. Now to wait for an opening...#$b#Oh hey, there's Seb, you two can create a distraction so I can sneak around the side...#$b#%Hmmm... hellfire soup has a certain ring to it, but not sure it would taste very good. Maybe it's time to run interference...",
		"sam.festival.summer11.spouse.first": "@! Ooof, you look frickin' amazing!$h#$b#I decided to give Lewis a break this year and not sneak anything into the soup.#$b#Unless you have any nefarious plans. If you do, I'm totally in!$h#$b#%Sam slips his arm around me, finding the gap under my shirt to press his hand against my belly.#$b#*whispers* Let's cool off in the shower together later... mmmm... maybe we can sneak out early? All I can think about is strip-- *Mmmmph*$l#$b#I quickly put my hand over Sam's mouth, and he kisses my palm.",
		"sam.festival.summer11.spouse.third": "@! Ooof, you look frickin' amazing!$h#$b#I decided to give Lewis a break this year and not sneak anything into the soup.#$b#Unless you have any nefarious plans. If you do, I'm totally in!$h#$b#%Sam slips his arm around @, quickly finding a gap to sneak his fingers through.#$b#*whispers* Let's cool off in the shower together later... mmmm... maybe we can sneak out early? All I can think about is strip-- *Mmmmph*$l#$b#Chuckling, @ covers Sam's mouth.",
		"sam.festival.summer28.y1": "Hey @, join us on the 'cool' dock! I'm really tempted to sneak up and push Seb in the water...$h#$b#I'd feel bad if he got stung by a jelly though, so maybe not a great idea.#$b#... Huh? I'm not staring! You just look good in this light. Um... you'll stand next to me, right?$l",
		"sam.festival.summer28.y2.single": "... $l#$b#... Huh? Okay, yeah I'm staring. You look amazing in this light, it makes your skin and hair glow.$l#$b#Ahem! Um, let's go hang with Seb and Abby, they mentioned watching a movie tonight, are you gonna go?#$b#I hope so, I kinda like watching movies next to you.$l",
		"sam.festival.summer28.y2.dating": "... $l#$b#... Huh? Okay, yeah I'm staring. You look amazing in this light, it makes your skin and hair glow.$l#$b#Not gonna lie, I REALLY want to kiss you right now.$l#$b#%In the weird light, Sam's eyes are almost luminescent... the glow flickers over his full lips... damn, he needs a kiss...#$b#*sighs* I don't care who's watching, let's do that again.$l",
		"sam.festival.summer28.spouse.y1.first": "Psst... it's dark and everyone is watching the water, wanna make out?$l#$b#OUCH!... Okay, okay, I'll wait until we're alone.#$b#%I wink at him and slide my hands into his back pockets.#$b#No fair! You're such a tease!#$b#*whispers* When we get home, my ass is yours.$l",
		"sam.festival.summer28.spouse.y1.third": "Psst... it's dark and everyone is watching the water, wanna make out?$l#$b#OUCH!... Okay, okay, I'll wait until we're alone.#$b#%@ winks, hands sliding into his back pockets.#$b#No fair! You're such a tease!#$b#*whispers* When we get home, my ass is yours.$l",
		"sam.festival.summer28.spouse.y2.first": "Time for the jelly show again!$h#$b#C'mere, rest your head on my shoulder. Don't worry, I'll keep my hands to myself for now.$l#$b#Sometimes I forget it can be nice to slow down and just live in the moment.#$b#Wow, I think you're rubbing off on me, I sound almost like a mature adult!$h#$b#%Laughing, I nuzzle Sam's neck, then nibble his earlobe.#$b#Hey now, it's not supposed to go the other way, haha! I'm glad things never get boring between us.$h",
		"sam.festival.summer28.spouse.y2.third": "Time for the jelly show again!$h#$b#C'mere, rest your head on my shoulder. Don't worry, I'll keep my hands to myself for now.$l#$b#Sometimes I forget it can be nice to slow down and just live in the moment.#$b#Wow, I think you're rubbing off on me, I sound almost like a mature adult!$h#$b#%Laughing, @ nuzzles Sam's neck, then nibbles his earlobe.#$b#Hey now, it's not supposed to go the other way, haha! I'm glad things never get boring between us.$h",
		"sam.festival.fall16.y1": "Hey @! Wanna try some of the games? Seb says they're all rigged, but it's still fun to play.$h#$b#Um, did you visit the fortune teller? She told me some cool stuff.$l#$b#I mean, you can interpret what she says however you want, but I hope what she told me comes true.#$b#%Sam grins, glancing away, eyes sparkling...#$b#Want some snacks? I'll grab some for us to share. Um... anything else you want?$h",
		"sam.festival.fall16.y2.single": "Have you gotten very many Star Tokens yet? I'm going for a big prize, like that giant stuffed dragon, Vince would LOVE that!$h#$b#Want some snacks? I'll grab some for us to share. Um... anything else you want?$h",
		"sam.festival.fall16.y2.dating": "Have you gotten very many Star Tokens yet? I'm going for a big prize, like that giant stuffed dragon, Vince would LOVE that!$h#$b#Want some snacks? I'll grab some for us to share.$h#$b#Sam grins, bouncing up and down on his toes.#$b#Let's visit the fortune teller together, then we can go bug Seb and Abby.$h",
		"sam.festival.fall16.spouse.y1": "Got everything for your grange display? I'll help you set it up.$h#$b#Check out these guns! *flexes* What do you think? Should I try the strength game? Haha!$h#$b#Maybe not, I watched Alex earlier and there's no way I'll beat his score. Now if they had a skating game, I'd totally kick his ass!$h",
		"sam.festival.fall16.spouse.y2": "Hmmm maybe we should shake things up and put something different in the grange display this year.$h#$b#Anyway, while you're doing that, I'll take Vince around to try the games.$h#$b#After the judging, let's pool our Star Tokens, maybe we can get a good prize this year! Is there anything you want?$h#$b#You've already got me... forever, I'm yours.$l",
		"sam.festival.fall27.y1.single.first": "Wow, @, you look amazing in that costume! Kinda wish I would have dressed up too.$h#$b#Want to try the maze? Don't worry, you can take out any monsters we might find.#$b#Uh, that sounded pretty lame, I mean I think it's really cool how you kick butt in the mines...$l#$b#%Sam blushes, then looks away, kicking a patch of grass with his toe.#$b#*sighs* Well, now that I sound like a total wuss, I guess I'll get a snack at the stand.$s#$b#%Huh, Sam is really embarrassed. I reach for his hand and head for the maze, he holds on tight.#$b#Um, if we find a dark corner... Just kidding!$l",
		"sam.festival.fall27.y1.single.third": "Wow, @, you look amazing in that costume! Kinda wish I would have dressed up too.$h#$b#Want to try the maze? Don't worry, you can take out any monsters we might find.#$b#Uh, that sounded pretty lame, I mean I think it's really cool how you kick butt in the mines...$l#$b#%Sam blushes, then looks away, kicking a patch of grass with his toe.#$b#*sighs* Well, now that I sound like a total wuss, I guess I'll get a snack at the stand.$s#$b#%Huh, Sam is really embarrassed. @ reaches for his hand and heads for the maze, he holds on tight.#$b#Um, if we find a dark corner... Just kidding!$l",
