		"sam.festival.fall27.spouse.y1": "Let's hit the snack stand before we try the maze, I'm starved!$h#$b#Once we fuel up, maybe we could get 'lost' for a while? There's a lot of dark corners where no one would find us.$l#$b#Though it is really creepy in there, you'll take care of me, right? Hold me tight... scare off the monsters... heh!$10#$b#Wonder if the wizard guy does that on purpose? Huh...",
		"sam.festival.fall27.spouse.y2": "I think I'm over my fear of the maze... maybe. Better get ready to navigate with me clinging to your side just in case.$h#$b#... No, I won't use it as an excuse to have my hands on your ass... I don't need an excuse for that, do I?$l#$b#*whispers* You look incredible... there sure are a lot of dark corners around here...$l",
		"sam.festival.winter8.y1.first": "Hey @! I have a huge stockpile of snowballs for the fight, wanna join me?$h#$b#I WILL have my revenge, Seb's never gonna see it coming!$h#$b#%I catch Seb out of the corner of my eye, his arm wound up and ready to let a snowball fly.#$b#%I jump back just in time and it hits Sam square in the rear.#$b#HEY!! SEB, YOU- alright, time to get serious!#$b#%Sam dives behind the barricade and snowballs start flying everywhere. What's that? I hear hot chocolate calling my name and head for the snack stand...",
		"sam.festival.winter8.y1.third": "Hey @! I have a huge stockpile of snowballs for the fight, wanna join me?$h#$b#I WILL have my revenge, Seb's never gonna see it coming!$h#$b#%@ catches sight of Seb, his arm wound up and ready to let a snowball fly, jumping back just in time as it hits Sam square in the rear.#$b#HEY!! SEB, YOU- alright, time to get serious!#$b#%Sam dives behind the barricade and snowballs start flying everywhere. What's that? @ hears hot chocolate calling and heads for the snack stand...",
		"sam.festival.winter8.y2.dating.first": "*gasping for breath* Did you see that shot?? It was amazing! I totally nailed Seb in the back of the neck!$h#$b#%-Seb's voice: SAM! When I catch you, you're a DEAD MAN!!-#$b#OH SHIT! Gotta go! I'll be back later... I hope!$8#$b#%Dang, I hope Sam makes it, but he did bring it on himself.#$b#%After a bit, Sam returns, covered head to foot in snow.#$b#*breathless* Oh man, I sure paid for that one. Worth it to see the look on Seb's face though! *shivers*$h#$b#Oh Yoba, I'm freezing! Come here, be my heater for a minute. Maybe... we can sneak back to your place and warm up?$l",
