	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_2.fall.first": "%Sam takes my hands and presses my fingers to his lips, gently kissing them.#$b#Vince was asking about you today.#$b#Let's plan a day with him, we can let him run around looking for treasure and totally wear himself out.$h#$b#We can sneak kisses when he's not looking.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_2.fall.third": "%Sam takes @'s hands and presses them to his lips.#$b#Vince was asking about you today.#$b#Let's plan a day with him, we can let him run around looking for treasure and totally wear himself out.$h#$b#We can sneak kisses when he's not looking.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_3.spring": "Welcome home @! How was your day today? Do anything exciting?$h#$b#C'mon, I made some hot drinks, curl up with me by the fire and you can tell me about it.#$b#Even if you just chopped a bunch of wood, I love hearing your stories.#$b#Sure, I can keep my hands to myself and let you finish talking...#$b#Well, I'll try at least... um, maybe we should do the touchy-feely stuff first?$10",
	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_3.summer": "Oh hey, I'm glad you're home, %pet decided to bring me a present today, I think it might have been alive once.$s#$b#So gross, but I guess that means %pet has accepted me into the family, right?#$b#Speaking of presents, I got you this, maybe we can make some tea?[340]$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_3.fall.first": "%There's my man... WHAA!! I step in a giant puddle, my feet sliding out from under me, sending me flying right into Sam.#$b#WOAH! Good thing I was here to catch you, usually it's me wiping out!$h#$b#%pet tracked in a lot of water today and I guess I missed a spot.#$b#You slid right into my arms and I'm not letting you go!$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_3.fall.third": "%@ walks in and immediately slips on a giant puddle, sliding right into Sam.#$b#WOAH! Good thing I was here to catch you, usually it's me wiping out!$h#$b#%pet tracked in a lot of water today and I guess I missed a spot.#$b#You slid right into my arms and I'm not letting you go!$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_4.spring": "Seb and I ran into George today and he was feeling particularly chatty.#$b#He told us an old legend about witches turning kids into doves...$8#$b#It was really creepy the way he told it, George is great at ghost stories!#$b#Y'know, there's a lot of weird old legends about this valley *shivers*",
	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_4.summer": "Oh, I found those old skatepark plans I drew up, kinda got me thinking...#$b#Wonder if I could design skateparks and stuff like that as a side job?#$b#I don't know if there's much demand for it, but it sure was fun planning and laying out the design... just something to think about I guess.#$b#Maybe I'll ask Seb about getting a computer program for drafting.",
	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_4.fall": "@, did you forget your jacket again?$s#$b#You're shivering! Get over here, I'll dry you off and get you some warm pajamas.#$b#OH! Uh, no, I'm not nagging you... would a nag kiss you like this? Heheh!$l#$b#I just worry about you sometimes.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_5.spring.female.first": "%*ACHOO!!* ugh... now I know how Sam feels. I wander over to Sam and plunk my head on his chest.#$b#@! What's wrong? Are you sick? Don't worry, I got you.#$b#%He scoops me up and plops me on the couch.#$b#Don't. Move. I'll be right back!#$b#%After a few minutes, he returns with my favorite fluffy blanket, a pillow, and a cup of tea.#$b#Okay, do you need anything else? Let me know if you do.#$b#%Pulling out his acoustic guitar, he sits cross-legged on the floor next to me.#$b#I'm gonna play your favorite songs, acoustic style. Tell me if you have a request.$h#$b#Soft music fills the air and I snuggle into my blanket.#$b#%After a while, I feel much better but decide to just stay on the couch listening to Sam play.[528]",
	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_5.spring.male.first": "%*ACHOO!!* ugh... now I know how Sam feels. I wander over to Sam and plunk my head on his chest.#$b#@! What's wrong? Are you sick? Don't worry, I got you.#$b#%He puts an arm around me and leads me to the couch.#$b#Don't. Move. I'll be right back!#$b#%After a few minutes, he returns with my favorite fluffy blanket, a pillow, and a cup of tea.#$b#Okay, do you need anything else? Let me know if you do.#$b#%Pulling out his acoustic guitar, he sits cross-legged on the floor next to me.#$b#I'm gonna play your favorite songs, acoustic style. Tell me if you have a request.$h#$b#Soft music fills the air and I hunker down into my blanket.#$b#%After a while, I feel much better but decide to just stay on the couch listening to Sam play.[528]",
