	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_5.summer.1": "*shouting from another room* Oh, hey {{endearment}}! I heard the door and I really wanted to tell you something!$18#$b#%Sam comes barreling out of the bathroom, a towel around his waist. He skids around the corner, the towel catching on a cabinet handle. *FWOOP!*#$b#Woah! Hey! What the-- where'd my towel go??", //SamShirtlessShock
	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_5.summer.2": "%Sam spins around, towel-less and, well, naked...#$b#Pfftt, whatever. Anyway there was something I was gonna tell you but I totally forgot. Huh.", //SamShirtlessGrin
	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_5.summer.3": "Why are you laughing? Never seen a guy lose his towel before? Pfft, okay, okay, now you're making me turn all red.", //SamShirtlessBlush
