	"sam.married.daily.Rainy_Night_5.fall": "The ducks are happy in this weather, they made a duck parade down to the pond.#$b#One of them left this cool feather, here ya go.[444]$h#$b#It's kinda wet and chilly, lets make some hot drinks and we can watch this new show I found.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_0.spring.female.first": "%Sam is on the couch upside down with is feet sticking up in the air... a golden opportunity!#$b#OH SHIT! No, stop!! HAHAHA! You monster, get away from my feet!$h#$b#%He manages to catch me around the waist and pulls me over the back of the couch on top of him.#$b#Oh yeah, I've got you now!$h#$e#%We wrestle for a moment before Sam stops for a kiss... that turns into many kisses... he grips my back, moaning into my mouth he shifts under me... oh Yoba, that's good...#$b#%Before long, our clothes are in a pile on the floor with Sam's face between my breasts as holds my hips, rocking under me...#$b#*breathless* If all tickle attacks end like that, you can sneak up on me any time...$l#$e#Oh hey, look what I found under the couch, here ya go!$h[72]",
