	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_0.summer": "Ooof Alex really worked us all hard yesterday, I can barely move... he's a monster!$s#$b#I'll just lie here on the floor... step over my body if you need...$s#$b#Hey, no tickling! Haha! Alright, get back here!$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_0.fall": "Um, I tried to make this recipe I found online and it turned out AWFUL, not even %pet wanted it.$s#$b#We're out of oregano and cocoa powder now... heheh, don't ask!#$b#I'll grab more at Pierre's later, wanna go out for dinner tonight? Let's call it a date.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_0.winter": "Hey {{endearment}}, I love seeing your face every day.$l#$b#When you're not here, I feel like a piece of me is missing.#$b#Huh, that expression about being two halves of one whole makes sense now, weird!$10#$b#C'mere, I want to be whole... *hugs*$l",
