	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_1.summer.first": "%Sam is strumming a few chords, then pausing to tap a rhythm on the side of his guitar and play again...#$e#Good morning! I'm working on the tune for a new song, Seb wrote the lyrics, I just need to get the sound right.#$b#%Sam pauses and stares at me for a moment... I glance down... is there something on my shirt?#$b#Oh no! You look... so hot... I was just sort of imagining if you decided to cool off and... y'know... get rid of those clothes.$l#$b#%Smirking, I make a ridiculous show of pulling off my offending shirt...#$b#Haha! I know you're trying to be funny but... damn... you're totally turning  me on...$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_1.summer.third": "%Sam is strumming a few chords, then pausing to tap a rhythm on the side of his guitar and play again...#$e#Good morning! I'm working on the tune for a new song, Seb wrote the lyrics, I just need to get the sound right.#$b#%Sam pauses and stares for a moment... @ glances down... is there something wrong?#$b#Oh no! You look... so hot... I was just sort of imagining if you decided to cool off and... y'know... get rid of those clothes.$l#$b#%Smirking, @ makes a ridiculous show of pulling off the offending shirt...#$b#Haha! I know you're trying to be funny but... damn... you're totally turning  me on...$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_1.fall": "Hey, wanna go for a walk?#$b#Last time I took Vince around the farm, we found this secret spot hidden in some trees. It was kinda magic feeling, like a fairy garden.#$b#I'll show you, the tree branches are shaped like an entrance and there's moss and ferns inside.$h#$b#Let's bring a blanket, it's the perfect place for... well, for making our own magic happen...$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_1.winter.first": "%Sam is strumming a few chords, then pausing to tap a rhythm on the side of his guitar and play again...#$e#Good morning! I'm working on the tune for a new song, Seb wrote the lyrics, I just need to get the sound right.#$b#%I step close and run my fingers through his hair, watching it spring back up... then caress his face and catch my fingers on his lower lip...#$b#... Mmmm... don't stop there, you're my muse... let's go make some different music, then maybe I'll find the right notes.$l#$b#%Sam sets the guitar aside and pulls me into a close embrace, swaying back and forth... I free him from his pants and pull him down on the couch...#$b#OHHH GOD... {{endearment}}... you know me so well...$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_1.winter.third": "%Sam is strumming a few chords, then pausing to tap a rhythm on the side of his guitar and play again...#$e#Good morning! I'm working on the tune for a new song, Seb wrote the lyrics, I just need to get the sound right.#$b#%Running fingers through his hair, @ watches it spring back up... then caresses his face, catching his lower lip...#$b#... Mmmm... don't stop there, you're my muse... let's go make some different music, then maybe I'll find the right notes.$l#$b#%Sam sets the guitar aside and pulls @ into a close embrace, swaying back and forth... freed from unwanted clothing they collapse on the couch together...#$b#OHHH GOD... {{endearment}}... you know me so well...$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_2.spring": "Damn, I had the weirdest dream last night! At least I hope it was a dream...$s#$b#I was kidnapped by ninja cows and taken to some strange planet ruled by cactus people.#$b#Hmmm maybe I ate too much cactus fruit. If you hear the cows talking, better listen in![90]$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_2.summer": "One of the chickens escaped the coop and was totally freakin' out!#$b#I've never heard so much squawking, except that day Mom caught us making out when I was supposed to be watching Vince... don't tell her I said that!$10#$b#I guess the poor bird was lost and confused? I put her back and the others ran up all clucking and making noise.#$b#Must have been a great adventure story she told!$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_2.fall": "Wanna go to the desert sometime and pick up some cactus fruit? Those things are frickin' amazing! And they make great jelly.$h#$b#We could get some ice cream too, and you can wear that outfit... you know the one.$l#$b#Can we grow an entire farm of cactuses? Cacti? Huh... either way, that would be awesome!$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_2.winter": "What kind of pizza toppings do you feel like?#$b#Gus gave me this crust and all I have to do is add the stuff on top and bake it.$h#$b#I think I'll go with the classic pepperoni and cheese.[206]$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_3.spring": "Hey, you were talking in your sleep last night, something about dinosaurs and a guy on stilts?#$b#Sounds like it was a wild dream! I don't remember mine, it definitely wasn't THAT interesting.#$b#If you ever have a nightmare, remember I'm always there to hold you tight.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_3.summer": "Good mor- WHAT IS THAT??!$8#$b#%Sam gestures wildly toward a shadowy corner and ducks behind me.#$b#Oh, um, heheh... It's just a fluff of pet hair floating around.$s#$b#When it moved, I thought it was a huge spider... Sorry about that!$10#$b#I mean, we COULD have a pet spider I suppose, but I kind of want to keep the guy contained... Wonder what happened to Frank...$9",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_3.fall": "Sorry about sprawling all over you last night, I couldn't get comfortable for some reason and kept feeling like I wanted to be closer to you.#$b#You're right, I guess on top of you is about as close as I can get... unless... Heh!$l#$b#...$l#$b#R-really? You want to... let's go, then!$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_3.winter": "Sorry about practically pushing you out of bed last night, I was FREEZING and kept trying to get closer to you.#$b#You're right, I guess on top of you is about as close as I can get... unless... Heh!$l#$b#...$l#$b#R-really? You want to... let's go, then!$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Indoor_Day_4.spring": "I was kinda wondering... am I what you hoped for in a husband?#$b#Nah, I'm not trying to be some stereotype of what a husband should be, you know me and I can't be anyone but myself.$h#$b#But if I'm doing anything annoying, tell me. I don't want to a pain in the butt or anything.[337]",
