	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_0.1.year1": "Those chickens are monsters!$s#$b#I found some cold pizza in the fridge so I was walking around eating it, and a hen just snatched the slice right out of my hand!$a#$b#Then she took off with it and shared it with the flock.#$b#How do you feel about ducks? Could we swap all the chickens in for another, more peaceful bird?$s",
