	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_1.2.ongoing.first": "I was just thinking...$l#$b#%Uh oh, Sam has that 'I have a great idea I didn't actually think through' look.#$b#It's so hot and sweaty and gross, wanna go swimming?#$e#Like go swimming here by the waterfall? Bring some ice cream and have a picnic...#$b#I guess we'd have to eat the ice cream first, then go swimming.#$b#Hmmm maybe have ice cream here and then go swimming? Or we could go to the beach, get ice cream at the stand and build sandcastles. Uh...$9#$b#%I decide to jump in and help Sam make plans for a fun beach day.",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_1.2.ongoing.third": "I was just thinking...$l#$b#%Uh oh, Sam has that 'I have a great idea I didn't actually think through' look.#$b#It's so hot and sweaty and gross, wanna go swimming?#$e#Like go swimming here by the waterfall? Bring some ice cream and have a picnic...#$b#I guess we'd have to eat the ice cream first, then go swimming.#$b#Hmmm maybe have ice cream here and then go swimming? Or we could go to the beach, get ice cream at the stand and build sandcastles. Uh...$9#$b#%@ decides to jump in and help Sam make plans for a fun beach day.",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_1.3": "What do you think of my little half pipe? Maybe we can expand that and have a mini-skatepark on the farm?#$b#I'm working on some new tricks, c'mon, I'll show you.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_2.1.first": "What's up today? Chores and then what? Wanna go run around in the woods and gather stuff? Maybe go fight some monsters?$h#$b#%Wow, how many cups of coffee did Sam drink this morning??#$e#%Sam grabs me around the waist and spins us around.#$b#I'm just so happy to be here with you! Let's go do something together. Doesn't matter what. *smooch*$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_2.1.third": "What's up today? Chores and then what? Wanna go run around in the woods and gather stuff? Maybe go fight some monsters?$h#$b#%Wow, how many cups of coffee did Sam drink this morning??#$e#%Sam grabs @ around the waist and spins the two of them around.#$b#I'm just so happy to be here with you! Let's go do something together. Doesn't matter what. *smooch*$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_2.2": "The sunrise sure is pretty! C'mere... I need to lean on you... sooooo sleepy...$s#$b#*yawns* I think I stayed up too late last night, can I just rest here on your shoulder?$l#$b#Awww this is nice, cozy and beautiful... zzz...$3",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_2.3.year1": "*whispers* I think the chickens are trying to get rid of me.$a#$e#They were all rolling around in a dust bath and looked really cute so I went to check it out...#$b#They must have thought I had pizza or something, they all ran up and shook dirt all over me!$s#$b#Then they started clucking to each other like they were laughing. Criminals!$s#$b#Now I need another shower... Hey, wanna come with me?$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_2.3.ongoing.first": "%Sam reaches skyward in a big stretch, his shirt riding up and showing his belly. I can't resist and trace my fingers down his midline.#$b#WOW! Uh... you just sent chills down my entire body... The uh... good kind.$l#$e#Are you going to follow through on that? I'll come out here and stretch every morning if you want to feel my abs...$10",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_2.3.ongoing.third": "%Sam reaches skyward in a big stretch, his shirt riding up and showing his belly. @ can't resist, running fingers down his midline.#$b#WOW! Uh... you just sent chills down my entire body... The uh... good kind.$l#$e#Are you going to follow through on that? I'll come out here and stretch every morning if you want to feel my abs...$10",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_3.1.first": "%Sam snakes his arm around me and grins.#$b#Smell the fresh air, no pollen today!$h#$e#Seb said he might pick up boxing, can you imagine him in the ring? That's crazy!$h#$b#If he does, maybe I'll spar with him. You can be the ref, I bet it would be a great show!",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_3.1.third": "%Sam snakes his arm around me and grins.#$b#Smell the fresh air, no pollen today!$h#$e#Seb said he might pick up boxing, can you imagine him in the ring? That's crazy!$h#$b#If he does, maybe I'll spar with him. You can be the ref, I bet it would be a great show!",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_3.2.year1.first": "I checked on the chickens today, just to make sure there's no evil plots afoot.#$b#You know that egg that's about to hatch? It was cheeping!#$b#The mother hen was clucking to the egg and the chick inside was cheeping back, she's turning the chick to the dark side while it's still in the egg!#$e#%Hmmm this chicken conspiracy might be getting out of hand... Sam obviously expects me to agree with his theory, but it's so hard to keep a straight face...",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_3.2.year1.third": "I checked on the chickens today, just to make sure there's no evil plots afoot.#$b#You know that egg that's about to hatch? It was cheeping!#$b#The mother hen was clucking to the egg and the chick inside was cheeping back, she's turning the chick to the dark side while it's still in the egg!#$e#%Hmmm this chicken conspiracy might be getting out of hand... Sam obviously expects @ to agree with his theory, but it's so hard to keep a straight face...",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_3.2.ongoing": "Let's put on some music and dance, I guess I'm feeling kinda romantic tonight.$h#$b#I want to hold you close and pretend we're the only people in the world.#$b#No responsibilities, no chores, just you and me and the music.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_3.3": "%Sam does a handstand and takes a few steps before flipping back to his feet.#$b#Ha! I've still got it!$h#$b#Gotta check once in a while, make sure I'm not turning into a boring married guy.#$b#I'd hate for you to think I was losing my fun side!$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_4.1.year1.first": "@, I swear that chicken is giving me the stink eye...$a#$b#I wonder if it's really an alien disguising itself as a chicken to spy on us...[520]#$b#... Sure, you're right, why would aliens care about our farm? But still... there's something weird about that bird.$9#$b#%What is up with Sam and that chicken? If it wasn't so ridiculous, I might actually be concerned.",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_4.1.year1.third": "@, I swear that chicken is giving me the stink eye...$a#$e#I wonder if it's really an alien disguising itself as a chicken to spy on us...[520]#$b#... Sure, you're right, why would aliens care about our farm? But still... there's something weird about that bird.$9#$b#%What is up with Sam and that chicken? If it wasn't so ridiculous, @ might actually be concerned.",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_4.1.ongoing": "@, I still kind of wonder if we have alien chickens...#$b#... There's just something strange about them, like they know more than we think.$7#$b#But if they are aliens, they must like it here, so they can stay. Maybe our farm is a refuge for traveling alien chickens.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_4.2": "Good thing I started doing upper body workouts with Alex back when we were dating.#$b#I definitely couldn't have survived farmwork before that!#$b#*flexes* Check out my guns, gonna give Alex a run for his money!$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Outdoor_4.3": "Oh, Seb gave me this, it's a present from Maru. She's working on some fancy irrigation system and doesn't need this sprinkler anymore.[645]#$e#They were both asking after you, wanna go up to the mountain for a game night soon?#$b#Maru said she'd join us. She and Seb seem to be getting along lately.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_0.spring": "Need me to run any errands today?#$b#I can check the commission boards and see what people are asking for, or put orders in at Robin's.$h#$b#If you ever need anything... water, a tool, a big ol' kiss... I'll come running!$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_0.summer": "I'm going to bug Mom for her fish casserole recipe. maybe we could make it together?$h#$b#That way I won't just make a giant mess and practically burn down the kitchen.$s",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_0.fall": "Man, I woke up cold today for some reason and haven't warmed up yet. C'mere, all I wanna do is snuggle up with you.#$b#*hugs*... You're so toasty warm... how about I just hang on to you all day?$h#$b#Aww, I guess it would be hard to work with me stuck to you. I can help though, c'mon, let's do this!$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_0.winter.first": "I slip my arms around Sam from behind and rest my head on his back, feeling him breathe. He clasps my hands and sighs.#$b#You're my favorite... heh!$l#$b#I'm about to go tune up my guitar, had to replace some strings. Then I have some song ideas I'd love to get your opinion on.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_0.winter.third": "@ hugs Sam from behind, resting on his back, feeling him breathe. He gives a contented sigh.#$b#You're my favorite...$l#$b#I'm about to go tune up my guitar, had to replace some strings. Then I have some song ideas I'd love to get your opinion on.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_1.spring": "Heh, I was just thinking about that time we snuck into my room through the window.$h#$b#Man, I that was the craziest thing, how did that even happen?$h#$e#Anyway, after that I really hated sleeping alone in my room, I knew I wanted to be with you forever and it was just weird being there instead of with you.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_1.summer.first": "%Sam embraces me, holding on tight.#$b#*muffled* I was talking to Dad yesterday and he told me some stories about the war...$s#$b#It was horrible, I can't even...$s#$b#%We hold each other for several minutes...#$b#I'm so glad you're here, I love you, @.",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_1.summer.third": "%Sam embraces me, holding on tight.#$b#*muffled* I was talking to Dad yesterday and he told me some stories about the war...$s#$b#It was horrible, I can't even...$s#$b#%We hold each other for several minutes...#$b#I'm so glad you're here, I love you, @.",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_1.fall.first": "Look what came in the mail, it's a joke gift for Seb, elevator shoes! Haha!$h#$b#I'll save them for his next birthday. He doesn't really say anything, but I know he hates that I'm taller than him.#$b#He's like an average dude but looks kinda short next to me.$h#$e#%Pfftt... Seb is NOT going to appreciate that gift. I wonder what kind of retaliation Sam is in for...",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_1.fall.third": "Look what came in the mail, it's a joke gift for Seb, elevator shoes! Haha!$h#$b#I'll save them for his next birthday. He doesn't really say anything, but I know he hates that I'm taller than him.#$b#He's like an average dude but looks kinda short next to me.$h#$e#%Pfftt... Seb is NOT going to appreciate that gift. @ wonders what kind of retaliation Sam is in for...",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_1.winter.first": "I cup Sam’s cheek, tracing my fingers down to his lips. His eyes flutter closed as he softly smiles.#$b#Remember when the Mayor busted me grinding my board on the planters and you saw the whole thing?#$e#I was so embarrassed! After I got the royal chewing out, I looked at you... and suddenly had the courage to stand up for myself.#$b#That was the first time anyone really listened to me... and now we have a nice town garden that everyone contributed to. The best things happen when we're together.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_1.winter.third": "@ cups Sam’s cheek, fingers tracing down to his lips. His eyes flutter closed as he softly smiles.#$b#Remember when the Mayor busted me grinding my board on the planters and you saw the whole thing?#$e#I was so embarrassed! After I got the royal chewing out, I looked at you... and suddenly had the courage to stand up for myself.#$b#That was the first time anyone really listened to me... and now we have a nice town garden that everyone contributed to. The best things happen when we're together.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_2.spring.first": "You always look amazing, even when you have dirt on your face or straw in your hair... actually, that makes you look even better.$h#$b#...$l#$b#... Pfft, you know exactly what I was thinking about!$l#$b#C'mere... remember that first time I wiped dirt off your face?$l#$e#Oh man, I was so embarrassed... but even so, all I could think about was how much I wanted to kiss you. *whispers* Like this...$l#$b#%Sam leans in, breath puffing softly against my skin... lips lightly brushing mine... parting slightly to kiss me gently, then with increasing passion until the world fades away and there's only me and Sam...",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_2.spring.third": "You always look amazing, even when you have dirt on your face or straw in your hair... actually, that makes you look even better.$h#$b#...$l#$b#... Pfft, you know exactly what I was thinking about!$l#$b#C'mere... remember that first time I wiped dirt off your face?$l#$e#Oh man, I was so embarrassed... but even so, all I could think about was how much I wanted to kiss you. *whispers* Like this...$l#$b#%Sam leans in, breath puffing softly against @'s skin... lips slightly parted for a gentle kiss that increases in passion until the world fades away and there's only @ and Sam...",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_2.summer": "C'mere, I need my morning kiss! *smooch*[70]$l#$e#... Mmmmm I was thinking earlier that I should do some laundry today, but now I suddenly don't feel like being responsible.#$b#I know you have work to do but... just a few minutes, it'll definitely be worth it!$l#$b#%Oh, Sam is always worth it...#$b#*moans* Oh {{endearment}}... you're so... amazing...$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_2.fall": "Remember our first camping trip? That was one of our best nights ever.$h#$b#There's been a lot of best nights since, but that one was really special.$l#$e#We should go camping again, there's something about being in the woods alone that's different from anywhere else.$h#$b#Heh... better stop thinking about that, I'm getting super horny... um... maybe we could camp in our backyard tonight?$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_2.winter.first": "What's up today? If you have time, I'll be practicing guitar and you can keep me company.$h#$b#%We head to the music room, Sam picks up his acoustic guitar sits cross-legged on the floor.#$b#%I snuggle up behind him and idly run my fingers along Sam’s ear as he plays, letting my mind drift with the music.",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_2.winter.third": "What's up today? If you have time, I'll be practicing guitar and you can keep me company.$h#$b#%They head to the music room, Sam picks up his acoustic guitar sits cross-legged on the floor.#$b#%@ snuggles up behind Sam, fingertips running idly along his ear as he plays, drifting with the music.",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_3.spring": "Hey {{endearment}}, let me know if you want to visit your family.#$e#Dad says there's been some breaks in the war so it's safer to travel now.#$b#We could stop in Zuzu City on the way, I always need more guitar picks!$h#$b#It's fun hanging out at your parents' place, all my songs are new to them.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_3.summer.first": "Are you going out to fight monsters today? Be careful, don't forget your protective gear and a med kit.#$b#And your phone, call me if you need anything, and if you get stuck, let me know and I'll call the cavalry to rescue you...#$b#%I nod and smile, watching the cute expressions on Sam's face as he goes on and on...[288]#$b#{{endearment}}... let me kiss you before you go... I love you.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_3.summer.third": "Are you going out to fight monsters today? Be careful, don't forget your protective gear and a med kit.#$b#And your phone, call me if you need anything, and if you get stuck, let me know and I'll call the cavalry to rescue you...#$b#%@ nods and smiles, watching the cute expressions on Sam's face as he goes on and on...[288]#$b#{{endearment}}... let me kiss you before you go... I love you.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_3.fall": "Let's go to Zuzu City soon, I need to grab some music stuff and new wheels for my board.#$b#We can catch up with Luca, look around at the shops, get some street food, maybe try out the ferris wheel in that one giant store.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_3.winter": "I'll help with feeding the animals today. I wonder what that chicken is up to, definitely nothing good!#$b#Gotta visit the ducks though, they're my buds!$h#$b#After the farm chores are done, let's do something fun like play a game or take a walk together.[536]$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_4.spring": "Hey uh, Penny said I should do more romantic things for you.#$b#$y '... Do you think I'm not romantic enough?_A candlelight dinner might be nice._Oh, yeah, sure! I can do that, it's okay if I get the food from Gus, right?$l_I'd rather just have fun with you._Really? Oh good, I got kinda worried for a second there, I'm really not great at the romance stuff. That's more Elliott's expertise!$h'",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_4.summer.first": "%Sam holds me close, slowly swaying back and forth, pressing his lips against my ear.#$b#I'm so glad you're here with me. I could never really imagine what I wanted my life to be like.#$b#Maybe I was a little afraid of the future, but now I don't want to be anywhere but here.#$b#*muffled* I love you, @...$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_4.summer.third": "%Sam holds @ close, slowly swaying back and forth...#$b#I'm so glad you're here with me. I could never really imagine what I wanted my life to be like.#$b#Maybe I was a little afraid of the future, but now I don't want to be anywhere but here.#$b#*muffled* I love you, @...$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_4.fall": "G'morning, {{endearment}} Look at this duck, she's so cute and happy! Can I keep her in the house?$h#$e#Awww okay, you're right she'd rather play in the pond. Y'know, ducks are really great, much better than those devious chickens.$h#$b#They give birds a bad name! One of them grabbed my shoelace and refused to let go!$a#$b#I have an idea, how about we give all the chickens to Shane, say it's a birthday present or something?$10",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_4.winter": "Hey, Robin made a bunch of pumpkin soup and gave me some for us to share.[236]#$e#I'm not usually a soup kind of guy, but Robin has some sort of magic skills and her soup tastes amazing!$h#$b#After we eat, let's chill for a bit, I'll mess around with the guitar, then we can burn off some of these extra calories.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_5.spring.female.first": "%Sam grins, then buries his face in my neck, breath tickling my skin.#$b#*muffled* Last night was... amazing... so, so good...$l#$b#%He looks up with that slightly crooked smile I can't resist, then nuzzles my ear, lightly nibbling my earlobe.#$b#Mmmm... I love your full body massages. You really know your way around me... maybe... I can return the favor tonight?[74]$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_5.spring.male.first": "%Sam grins, then buries his face in my neck, breath tickling my skin.#$b#*muffled* Last night was... amazing... so, so good...$l#$b#%He looks up with that slightly crooked smile I can't resist, then nuzzles my ear, lightly nibbling my earlobe.#$b#Mmmm... I love your full body massages. You really know your way around me... maybe... I can return the favor tonight?[74]$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_5.spring.neutral.first": "%Sam grins, then buries his face in my neck, breath tickling my skin.#$b#*muffled* Last night was... amazing... so, so good...$l#$b#%He looks up with that slightly crooked smile I can't resist, then nuzzles my ear, lightly nibbling my earlobe.#$b#Mmmm... I love your full body massages. You really know your way around me... maybe... I can return the favor tonight?[74]$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_5.spring.female.third": "%Sam grins, then buries his face in @'s neck, breath tickling her skin.#$b#*muffled* Last night was... amazing... so, so good...$l#$b#%He looks up with that slightly crooked smile she can't resist, then nuzzles her ear, lightly nibbling her earlobe.#$b#Mmmm... I love your full body massages. You really know your way around me... maybe... I can return the favor tonight?[74]$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_5.spring.male.third": "%Sam grins, then buries his face in @'s neck, breath tickling his skin.#$b#*muffled* Last night was... amazing... so, so good...$l#$b#%He looks up with that slightly crooked smile @ can't resist, then nuzzles his ear, lightly nibbling his earlobe.#$b#Mmmm... I love your full body massages. You really know your way around me... maybe... I can return the favor tonight?[74]$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_5.spring.neutral.third": "%Sam grins, then buries his face in @'s neck, breath tickling their skin.#$b#*muffled* Last night was... amazing... so, so good...$l#$b#%He looks up with that slightly crooked smile @ can't resist, then nuzzles their ear, lightly nibbling their earlobe.#$b#Mmmm... I love your full body massages. You really know your way around me... maybe... I can return the favor tonight?[74]$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_5.summer.first": "...$l#$b#Oh, um... remember when we were dating... some of the things we did under the blankets when we were watching movies?$l#$b#%Hmmm I seem to remember something like that happening a few days ago...#$b#Heh! Yeah, we still do that... it's just less sneaky now, haha!$h",
