	"sam.married.daily.Good_5.fall.female.first": "%Oh, there's that cowboy hat I was looking for, just sitting on the table. I bet it would look great on Sam... I plunk it on Sam's head.#$b#Huh? Oh, ha! How do I look? *raises an eyebrow* Pretty hot, right?$10#$e#%Damn... Sam does look good in a cowboy hat. He grins, then wraps his arms around me, dipping me low... leaning down to catch my bottom lip between his, then kisses me...#$b#{{endearment}}... you're so beautiful...$l#$b#%Sam's bright eyes soften as he gazes into mine.#$b#%He caresses my cheek, then trails his fingers down my throat, over my breasts to my belly...#$b#*whispers* Come ride me like you own me...$l",
