	"sam.married.daily.Good_6.spring.first": "Are you going fishing today? I can come, I won't fish but I can play my game while you do that.$h#$b#%Hmm... the last time we went fishing together, I ended up with no fish and had to drag Sam out of the river.#$b#Huh, your expression says you're thinking about last time. I swear I'll stay away from the water and keep my hands to myself, promise!$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_6.spring.third": "Are you going fishing today? I can come, I won't fish but I can play my game while you do that.$h#$b#%Hmm... @ thinks back on the last time they went together... the only 'fishing' involved dragging Sam out of the river.#$b#Huh, your expression says you're thinking about last time. I swear I'll stay away from the water and keep my hands to myself, promise!$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_6.summer.first": "%Sam is holding a jar and is covered in what looks like... peanut butter?#$b#Ugh, I just wanted to make a sandwich, but the peanut butter was empty.#$b#I got a new jar and tried to stir it up, but dang, that's hard! I have peanut butter all over my hands, the counter, everywhere.$s#$b#*sighs* I'll clean this up, but do you want to take over the mixing?#$b#%Grinning, I take the jar from Sam, then lick the peanut butter off one of his fingers.#$b#Uh, there's some on my face, and probably other places too.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_6.summer.third": "%Sam is holding a jar and is covered in what looks like... peanut butter?#$b#Ugh, I just wanted to make a sandwich, but the peanut butter was empty.#$b#I got a new jar and tried to stir it up, but dang, that's hard! I have peanut butter all over my hands, the counter, everywhere.$s#$b#*sighs* I'll clean this up, but do you want to take over the mixing?#$b#%Grinning, @ takes the jar from Sam, then licks the peanut butter off one of his fingers.#$b#Uh, there's some on my face, and probably other places too.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_6.fall.first": "Hey, are you heading to the mines today?#$b#Be careful, okay? I always worry about you when you're down there, but you'll be fine. And I'll be fine.#$b#I'll just be sitting here, waiting for you to come back. Head in my hands. Sobbing...$s#$b#%Pfft, what drama! I ruffle his hair and kiss his cheek.#$b#Oh, alright, I know you need the resources. Gimme a real kiss before you leave, though.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_6.fall.third": "Hey, are you heading to the mines today?#$b#Be careful, okay? I always worry about you when you're down there, but you'll be fine. And I'll be fine.#$b#I'll just be sitting here, waiting for you to come back. Head in my hands. Sobbing...$s#$b#%Pfft, what drama! @ ruffles his hair and kisses his cheek.#$b#Oh, alright, I know you need the resources. Gimme a real kiss before you leave, though.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.Good_6.winter": "Mmm, I still feel a tingle up my arm when you touch my hand.$l#$b#Just like that day I dropped the egg and we both grabbed the cleaning cloth.$h#$b#For days after that, I came up with crazy plans to hold your hand, like going in the mine together at night, walking across a rickety bridge...#$b#Me biting it on my board and you helping me up... That one actually happened and it wasn't nearly as fun as I imagined...[337]$s",
	"sam.married.daily.Neutral_0": "You'll tell me if I'm being annoying or whatever, right?$s#$b#I know my energy is a bit much sometimes and I don't want to be a pain.$s",
	"sam.married.daily.Neutral_2": "Ugh, I didn't sleep well last night, just couldn't get comfortable. Can we skip today and go back to bed?$s#$b#Yeah, I guess that's not really an option. Okay, I'll find something productive to do today.$s",
	"sam.married.daily.Neutral_3": "Can I run some errands for you today?#$b#I need some more human interaction while you're busy, recharge my batteries I guess.#$b#Oh, no, it's not that I'm lonely here with you, sometimes I just need to be around a lot of people.$s",
	"sam.married.daily.funLeave_Sam.1": "Hey! I'm meeting up with Seb and Shane today, recording some new music videos.#$b#Text me if you need anything, and come by to watch if you want, you're always welcome. *smooch*$h",
	"sam.married.daily.funLeave_Sam.2": "@, I'm taking Vince out for some brother time, he's been pretty lonely lately.#$b#Let's plan another picnic with him, maybe go on some exploring adventures, he'd love that, especially if we all go together. *smooch*$h",
	"sam.married.daily.funLeave_Sam.3": "Mom asked me to come by and visit, I bet she'll send me home with leftover casserole we can have for dinner.$h#$b#Anything you want from Pierre's? I don't mind running a few errends while I'm out.",
	"sam.married.daily.funLeave_Sam.4.first": "$d kent#I'm gonna hang out with Dad today, maybe show him some of my new skating tricks.#$b#Maybe just doing normal stuff will help him feel a little better.#$b#%Sam starts to leave, then turns back to give me a big hug.#$b#I'm so lucky I have you. *smooch*|I think I'll bug Seb today, see if he's done editing the new music videos.#$b#Then probably stop by the saloon and pick up something for dinner. What sounds good?", //translation ' $d kent# ' is code, do not translate it
	"sam.married.daily.funLeave_Sam.4.third": "$d kent#I'm gonna hang out with Dad today, maybe show him some of my new skating tricks.#$b#Maybe just doing normal stuff will help him feel a little better.#$b#%Sam starts to leave, then turns back to give @ a big hug.#$b#I'm so lucky I have you. *smooch*|I think I'll bug Seb today, see if he's done editing the new music videos.#$b#Then probably stop by the saloon and pick up something for dinner. What sounds good?",
	"sam.married.daily.funLeave_Sam.5": "What's your plan for today? Don't forget to take breaks, drink water, all that stuff... huh... that sounded a lot like my mom...#$b#I'm thinking I'll hit the gym, Seb said he'd be going today... speaking of Mom, I'll probably stop by to see her on my way home. *smooch*$h",
	"sam.married.daily.funReturn_Sam.1.first": "Hey! How'd everything go today?$h#$b#Nothing too exciting going on, Seb got the new videos posted and they're doing good on the channel, people like the new set and are buying the downloads.$h#$b#%Sam takes my hands, rubbing his thumbs over my fingers...#$b#...$l#$b#Oh it's nothing, I was just thinking about things we could do later.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.funReturn_Sam.1.third": "Hey! How'd everything go today?$h#$b#Nothing too exciting going on, Seb got the new videos posted and they're doing good on the channel, people like the new set and are buying the downloads.$h#$b#%Sam takes @'s hands, rubbing them with his thumbs...#$b#...$l#$b#Oh it's nothing, I was just thinking about things we could do later.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.funReturn_Sam.2": "*hugs* Ahhh, you're back, I missed you like crazy.$l#$b#*muffled* I know, I always miss you so much... I don't want to let you go... let's curl up and watch a show or something.[237]$h",
	"sam.married.daily.funReturn_Sam.3.first": "%Sam presses my fingers to his lips, closing his eyes.#$b#Mmmm I missed you today, Vince was asking after you, Mom too.#$b#She wants us to come to dinner more often, I think she needs a distraction for Vince.[279]$h",
	"sam.married.daily.funReturn_Sam.3.third": "%Sam presses @'s fingers to his lips, closing his eyes.#$b#Mmmm I missed you today, Vince was asking after you, Mom too.#$b#She wants us to come to dinner more often, I think she needs a distraction for Vince.[279]$h",
	"sam.married.daily.funReturn_Sam.4.first": "%Sam wraps his arms around me from behind, burying his face in my neck.#$b#*smooch* ...$l#$b#Wait, don't go yet, I need to be close to you...$l#$b#Let's go hang out on the couch, you can help me respond to comments on the video channel, okay?",
	"sam.married.daily.funReturn_Sam.4.third": "%Sam wraps his arms around me from behind, burying his face in my neck.#$b#*smooch* ...$l#$b#Wait, don't go yet, I need to be close to you...$l#$b#Let's go hang out on the couch, you can help me respond to comments on the video channel, okay?",
	"sam.married.daily.funReturn_Sam.5.first": "%Music is playing, Sam takes my hands and twirls me around...#$b#I think we're getting better at this, haha!$h#$b#I picked up some chips and dip, let's have a movie night!$h",
	"sam.married.daily.funReturn_Sam.5.third": "%Music is playing, Sam takes @'s hands, leading a dance around the room...#$b#I think we're getting better at this, haha!$h#$b#I picked up some chips and dip, let's have a movie night!$h",
	"sam.married.daily.patio_Sam.1.female.first": "Watch this!#$b#%Sam executes a perfect kickflip, then a heelflip.#$b#All my practice is paying off!$h#$b#%I smirk and do a handstand, taking a few steps before my shirt rides up over my face, basically flashing Sam...#$b#%That was less than graceful, I quickly flip back to my feet, yanking my shirt back down. Pfftt, maybe I can pretend that was on purpose.#$b#Haha! That's awesome! I especially liked the show at the end! C'mere... *hugs*$l",
