	"sam.married.daily.patio_Sam.2": "Man, I need to clean my wheels and bearings, sometimes I forget to give my board the love and attention it needs.#$b#Have you seen my socket wrench? I think it fell behind the dryer.$s#$b#Huh? You also need love and attention? Say no more! I happen to be your personal love machine!$l",
	"sam.married.daily.patio_Sam.3.first": "Wanna try skating? I can tighten up the trucks real quick and you can give it a shot!$h#$b#It's balance and getting used to how the board feels under your feet, I bet you'd pick up the basics with no problem.$h#$b#%I step on the board... WOAH!! It immediately shoots out from under me and I find myself in Sam's arms.#$b#Yikes, gotcha! Yeah the board really flies on the halfpipe, maybe we should start on a flat and textured surface.$h#$b#But now that I have you in my arms, I don't want to let you go just yet.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.patio_Sam.3.third": "Wanna try skating? I can tighten up the trucks real quick and you can give it a shot!$h#$b#It's balance and getting used to how the board feels under your feet, I bet you'd pick up the basics with no problem.$h#$b#%@ steps on the board... It immediately shoots out, sending @ flying into Sam's arms.#$b#Woah, gotcha! Yeah the board really flies on the halfpipe, maybe we should start on a flat and textured surface.$h#$b#But now that I have you in my arms, I don't want to let you go just yet.$l",
	"sam.married.daily.patio_Sam.4": "Could we maybe expand this little corner here? I wouldn't need much more space, just a little to add some rails.#$b#I could go up to the skatepark, but sometimes I want to stay close to the house. Not a big deal, just whenever.#$b#I'll burn off a bit more energy here, then do you wanna go bother Seb for a while?#$b#I have some good stories saved up for him, plus I'm gonna steal some of that saltwater taffy he has.$h",
	"sam.married.daily.patio_Sam.5": "It's great having this halfpipe by the house, then I can burn off some energy whenever I need.#$b#Oh, do you need some help? I'm all yours whenever you want!$h#$b#Just, uh, let me know, my hands are ready to hold your tools, an animal, some crops, you... especially you!$l",
