	"sam.married.daily.OneKid_1.1.neutral.third": "%Sam walks up and collapses on @'s shoulder.#$b#It's early and I'm already worn out. %kid1 is determined to knock me out and take over!$s#$e#%Sam's hands start wandering, sliding up under @'s shirt, stroking their chest.#$b#Now that %kid1 is sleeping, let's go do some grown-up activities...$l#$b#%Sam doesn't need to ask twice, @ grabs his ass and pulls him tight against them, kissing his ear and neck, feeling him up.#$e#Ohhhh {{endearment}}... I need you so much, let's go hide in the bedroom.$l#$b#%They escape under a pile of blankets on the bed, he whimpers and moans as @ massages all his favorite places, the blankets muffling the sounds.#$b#*breathing heavily* I can't get enough of you, we need more breaks like this...$l#$b#%@ drapes an arm over Sam, holding him tight, feeling him relax and soon fall asleep.",
	"sam.married.daily.OneKid_2.1": "Pfftt, look at that little goober! C'mon, %kid1, you can't make a nest in the clean laundry!$h#$b#*%kid1 squeals* I have a feeling we are the parents of a future disturber of the peace!#$b#We'll need to come up with some activities, no skateboarding yet but I think it's coming.#$b#What do you think about having a second kid? To keep this one entertained.$9#$b#Yeah, you're right, it probably won't work out that way, but still... maybe another one would be twice as fun?$h",
	"sam.married.daily.OneKid_3.1.first": "%kid1 wants you to do the tucking in tonight. I think the request was for a book and kiss goodnight. And a song, but I've got that covered!$h#$b#When you're done, I need my kiss goodnight too.$h#$b#I kinda miss doing whatever we want whenever we want with as few clothes as we want, but I guess that's part of the family thing.$l#$b#%I kiss Sam, then catch his bottom lip gently in my teeth... he moans softly.#$b#Oh yeah... I'll be waiting in bed for you, don't take too long, okay?$l",
	"sam.married.daily.OneKid_3.1.third": "%kid1 wants you to do the tucking in tonight. I think the request was for a book and kiss goodnight. And a song, but I've got that covered!$h#$b#When you're done, I need my kiss goodnight too.$h#$b#I kinda miss doing whatever we want whenever we want with as few clothes as we want, but I guess that's part of the family thing.$l#$b#%@ kisses Sam, lightly pulling his bottom lip... he moans softly.#$b#Oh yeah... I'll be waiting in bed for you, don't take too long, okay?$l",
	"sam.married.daily.TwoKids_0.1.female.first": "%Sam is lying on the couch, one foot hanging over the back and one arm on the floor, snoring.#$b#%Sprawled out across Sam's belly is %kid2, also sacked out. %kid1 is on the floor, one leg over Sam's arm and clutching a stuffed toy... Definitely nap time!#$b#I retrieve %kid2, depositing the sleepy child in bed and doing the same for %kid1. Sam groans and opens one eye.#$b#Ohhh heeeyyy... You're really nice and pretty...$l#$b#%I hoist a bleary-eyed Sam up and help him to bed.#$b#It's daytime, I should be awake... but those little weirdos got me up super early and didn't fall asleep until just a bit ago.#$b#%Smiling, I climb back into bed, resting my head on Sam’s chest, listening to his heart beat gradually slow as he drifts off to sleep.",
