		"sam.event.introduction.6.1.third": "Back on his feet, Sam brushes the dirt off his pants... loose skater pants with zippers everywhere, orange tee with some kind of faded image of a green alien, and a worn denim jacket...#He grins, running long fingers through spiky blonde hair, light glinting in his bright eyes.",
		"sam.event.introduction.7.female": "You really okay? I'm so, so sorry about that... what a crazy way to meet a stunning- ah... I mean, um... well, at least Lewis didn't see that.$10",
		"sam.event.introduction.7.male": "You really okay? I'm so, so sorry about that... what a crazy way to meet someone... well, at least Lewis didn't see that.$10",
		"sam.event.introduction.8.first": "Well, Sam sure made an impression, I certainly won't forget him!#I manage to stutter out my name... I just moved in to the old farm, and literally fell in your lap...",
		"sam.event.introduction.8.third": "Sam sure made an impression that will be hard to forget!#{{farmerName}} manages to recover enough to explain moving in to the old farm up to literally falling into Sam's lap...", //Edit for code
		"sam.event.introduction.9": "OH! You're taking over that old place? Damn, you have a lot of work ahead of you! Heh, obviously you know that already...$9#$b#Anyway, before I say something even more stupid, I'll let you go... It was nice to meet you, @... uh... yeah. See you around?$l",
		"sam.event.introduction.10": "What the- SAM!!$a",

	//Movie Night //core version for DSV
		"sam.event.MovieNight.1": "So... how many 'It Howls in the Rain' sequels are there anyway?",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.2": "This is 17. I've been counting the days for the release, it has some cutting-edge special effects!$h",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.3": "Uhhh Sam, are you SURE you want to watch this movie?",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.4": "Oh yeah! I can't wait! Heh... heh... *sighs*$s",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.5": "You can bail if you want, then there'd be more room on the couch.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.6": "No way! I'm good, are you good, @?$h",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.7": "If you say so, but no screaming in my ear.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.8": "I don't scream. *whispers* He's making that up...$s",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.9": "WOW!! I didn't see that one coming, did you, Seb?$7",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.10": "Abby, watch it. You're gonna spill soda all over my couch.$s",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.11": "HAHAHA! I saw that Sam, you chicken!$h",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.12.female.first": "Woah! Hey! My handful of popcorn is halfway to my mouth, Abby hits my arm and before I can stop myself I'm nearly shoved on top of Sam, popcorn flying, and my hand lands squarely on fabric... denim... zipper... soft and warm... oh Yoba...",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.12.male.first": "Woah! Hey! My handful of popcorn is halfway to my mouth, Abby hits my arm and before I can stop myself I'm nearly shoved on top of Sam, popcorn flying, and my hand lands squarely on his crotch... oh Yoba...",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.12.neutral.first": "Woah! Hey! My handful of popcorn is halfway to my mouth, Abby hits my arm and before I can stop myself I'm nearly shoved on top of Sam, popcorn flying, and my hand lands squarely on his crotch... oh Yoba...",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.12.female.third": "Abby bumps {{farmerName}}'s arm, sending popcorn flying and shoving her on top of Sam...#@'s hand lands squarely on fabric... denim... zipper... soft and warm...",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.12.male.third": "Abby bumps {{farmerName}}'s arm, sending popcorn flying and shoving him on top of Sam...#@'s hand lands squarely on fabric... denim... zipper... soft and warm...",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.12.neutral.third": "Abby bumps {{farmerName}}'s arm, sending popcorn flying and shoving them on top of Sam...#@'s hand lands squarely on fabric... denim... zipper... soft and warm...",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.13": "Oh, sorry @! I didn't mean to make you spill your popcorn, that's my fault!$7",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.14.female.first": "Abby is leaning heavily on my side as Sam squirms, and I feel him start to stiffen... I suck in a breath as tingling flares in my core.#For Sam's sake, I shove Abby back and stand up... Maybe if I start cleaning up this popcorn mess, no one will notice what just happened...",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.14.male.first": "Abby is leaning heavily on my side as Sam squirms, and I feel him start to stiffen... I suck in a breath as I feel myself twitch to life.#For Sam's sake, I shove Abby back and stand up... Maybe if I start cleaning up this popcorn mess, no one will notice what just happened...",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.14.neutral.first": "Abby is leaning heavily on my side as Sam squirms, and I feel him start to stiffen... I suck in a breath as tingling flares in my core.#For Sam's sake, I shove Abby back and stand up... Maybe if I start cleaning up this popcorn mess, no one will notice what just happened...",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.14.female.third": "Sam squirms and {{farmerName}} feels him start to stiffen, setting off tingling in her core... for Sam's sake, she shoves Abby back and stands up, muttering something about cleaning up this mess.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.14.male.third": "Sam squirms and {{farmerName}} feels him start to stiffen, setting off tingling in his groin... for Sam's sake, he shoves Abby back and stands up, muttering something about cleaning up this mess.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.14.neutral.third": "Sam squirms and {{farmerName}} feels him start to stiffen, setting off tingling in their groin... for Sam's sake, they shove Abby back and stand up, muttering something about cleaning up this mess.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.15": "Ugh, there's popcorn everywhere...$a",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.16": "I gotta... Awww fu- I'm out. Later!$8",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.17": "SAM! Aren't you gonna help clean up??$a",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.18": "Abby, everyone knows it's your fault. Don't make @ do all the work.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.19": "Fine... See? I knew Sam couldn't handle a scary movie. What a weenie baby! Haha!$h",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.20.female.first": "... of all the things she could have called him... well, he's definitely not a baby in that department. Heehee!#Poor Sam, he's probably dying of embarrassment. I'll catch him after he's had time to recover and apologize.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.20.male.first": "... of all the things she could have called him... well, he's definitely not a baby in that department. Aaaand I better think about something else.#Poor Sam, he's probably dying of embarrassment. I'll catch him after we've both had time to recover and apologize.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.20.neutral.first": "... of all the things she could have called him... well, he's definitely not a baby in that department!#Poor Sam, he's probably dying of embarrassment. I'll catch him later and apologize.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.20.female.third": "{{farmerName}} cringes slightly, of all the things Abby could have called him...#@ decides to find Sam later and apologize.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.20.male.third": "{{farmerName}} cringes slightly, of all the things Abby could have called him...#@ decides to find Sam later and apologize.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.20.neutral.third": "{{farmerName}} cringes slightly, of all the things Abby could have called him...#@ decides to find Sam later and apologize.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.21": "Damn. Movie night is a bust, I'll just watch it later.$s#$b#Sam looked kinda sick when he took off, I'll go find him.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.22": "Hey man, are you alright?",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.23": "Fine. Might die of humiliation, but that's it.$s",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.24": "You didn't see? Well, hopefully Abby didn't either or I'll never hear the end of it.$s",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.25.female": "*sighs* When Abby shoved @, she accidentally grabbed my... yeah. Totally. And... nature took over. Big time. Y'know.$s",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.25.male": "*sighs* When Abby shoved @, he accidentally grabbed my... yeah. Totally. And... nature took over. Big time. Y'know.$s", //Edit
		"sam.event.MovieNight.25.neutral": "*sighs* When Abby shoved @, they accidentally grabbed my... yeah. Totally. And... nature took over. Big time. Y'know.$s", //Edit
		"sam.event.MovieNight.26": "Damn, dude... you have the worst luck... or the best, not sure which.",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.27.female": "Sure couldn't just stay there or it would've been freakin' obvious so had to bail. I'm sure she felt that too. Of all the people...$s#$b#Uh, well. If it had to happen, I'm glad it was her... not that I want her to feel me... I DO but... aww shit. You know what I mean.$l",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.27.male": "Sure couldn't just stay there or it would've been freakin' obvious so had to bail. I'm sure he felt that too. Of all the people...$s#$b#Uh, well. If it had to happen, I'm glad it was him... not that I want him to feel me... I DO but... aww shit. You know what I mean.$l",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.27.neutral": "Sure couldn't just stay there or it would've been freakin' obvious so had to bail. I'm sure they felt that too. Of all the people...$s#$b#Uh, well. If it had to happen, I'm glad it was them... not that I want them to feel me... I DO but... aww shit. You know what I mean.$l",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.28": "Yoba, Sam, you sure can't keep a secret, haha!$h",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.29.first": "... Wow... that was not the movie night I expected... but I know what I'll be dreaming about tonight...",
		"sam.event.MovieNight.29.third": "That was not the expected movie night... {{farmerName}} smiles, thinking back on the evening's events.",

	//Sidestep
		"sam.event.Sidestep.1": "Oh, hi @... what's up? I'm just running some errands for my mom.$7",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.2": "Yeah she has a few new projects for clients from Zuzu, her custom furniture is pretty popular. So I'm picking up some orders that came in at Pierre's.",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.3": "Yo! @ and Seb! I just got off Vince entertainment duty, so I'm grabbing some snacks.$h",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.4": "Are you doing anything fun today, @? If you want, we could-",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.5": "Hey, look! It's all my favorite people!$h",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.6": "I heard you guys talking about your sewer adventure the other day, next time make sure you invite me, I totally missed out.",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.7": "Well, we really didn't see...",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.8": "No way, we definitely saw something. @ saw it too right?",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.9": "I want to see for myself next time, you have an incurably wild imagination and Seb chronically under-shares.#$b#If there really is a mutant giant frog down there, I want proof!$h",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.10": "OOOF!!",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.11.first": "Wha- Dark hoodie replaced by wide turquoise eyes and- mmphh!!#Sam's face, lips pressed hard against mine, hands grasping for anything stable to stop his forward momentum...#I grab him as I stumble back, clutching his jacket in my fists as he finds his footing.",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.11.third": "Sam stumbles forward just as Sebastian sidesteps, arms pinwheeling as he crashes into {{farmerName}}, mouth to mouth, eyes wide...",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.11.1": "Sam gasps...",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.11.2": "Step back and laugh it off.",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.11.3": "Take a chance and hold him.",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.11.4.first": "I start to step back and catch Sam's eyes, wide in surprise... he grins, his face flushing red all the way to his ears...",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.11.4.third": "{{farmerName}} starts to step back and catches Sam's eyes, wide in surprise... he grins, his face flushing red all the way to his ears...",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.11.5.first": "For an instant everything grinds to a halt... my eyes flicker closed, Sam takes a startled breath as his lips soften, my hands flattening against his back...", //flag MaggSamKissBack
		"sam.event.Sidestep.11.5.third": "For an instant everything grinds to a halt... {{farmerName}}'s eyes flicker closed, Sam takes a startled breath as his lips soften, {{farmerName}}'s hands flattening against his back...",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.12": "*whispers* @...$l",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.13": "Abby, watch it! I almost got a facefull of Sam!$a",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.14.first": "Time snaps back into motion, Sam releases me and steps back, heat racing up my neck to match his red cheeks...#Blinking, I stutter something incoherent...",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.14.third": "Time snaps back into motion, Sam steps back, blushing and disoriented, {{farmerName}} blinks, muttering something incoherent...",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.15": "OH!! @! Are you okay? I... I didn't mean... why is this happening...$8",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.16": "Here's the supplies Robin ordered, Sebastian. Everything is here and ready to go, if she needs anything else, I'm happy to place the order.",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.17": "Oh, yeah, thanks.",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.18": "@, it's always good to see you, do you need any help there?$h",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.19": "Yeah, sure, I can carry stuff for you.$l",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.20": "Dad, I'm going to help Seb with Robin's order, I finished my work so I'll be home later.",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.21.female": "Pffttt... Did you see the look on @'s face when Sam went flying into her? Haha!$h",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.21.male": "Pffttt... Did you see the look on @'s face when Sam went flying into him? Haha!$h",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.21.neutral": "Pffttt... Did you see the look on @'s face when Sam went flying into them? Haha!$h",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.22": "You didn't do that on purpose, did you?$s",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.23": "No! Seriously, I had no idea Sam was just going to lose his balance like that.#$b#But... you gotta admit, it's about time he kissed @, even if it was by accident, haha!$h",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.24": "Not sure those two would agree, but whatever... Sam really is strangely lucky... huh.",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.25": "About earlier, I uh... well, your lips are really... um, never mind, heheh!$l", //just kiss him for real already!
		"sam.event.Sidestep.26.female": "Sam grins and looks away, he's so ridiculously cute...",
		"sam.event.Sidestep.26.male": "Sam grins and looks away, he's so ridiculously attractive...",

	//Lovestruck
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.1": "Oh hey @, I didn't know you were over here or I would have come by sooner!$l#$b#Uh, Seb, could I talk to you for a sec? Sorry @, I hope you don't mind.",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.2.first": "I take the hint and head out, glancing back over my shoulder at the guys.#Seb smiles slightly and Sam gives me a big cheesy grin.#Yoba, he's cute... Seb's got the dark and edgy thing going on, but Sam... there's something about him.#It's funny how such different people could be such good friends...",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.2.third": "{{farmerName}} heads towards the door, glancing back at the guys.#Seb smiles slightly and Sam gives a big cheesy grin... It's funny how such different people could be such good friends.",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.3": "*sigh*",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.4": "Alright, what's up?$s",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.5.female": "I just uh... wanted your opinion on something. Um... huh, this is kind of weird, for some reason I'm not sure how to say this...#$b#... What do you think of @? You know, do you think maybe she likes me?#$b#I mean, as more than a friend...",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.5.male": "I just uh... wanted your opinion on something. Um... huh, this is kind of weird, for some reason I'm not sure how to say this...#$b#... What do you think of @? You know, do you think maybe he likes me?#$b#I mean, as more than a friend...",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.5.neutral": "I just uh... wanted your opinion on something. Um... huh, this is kind of weird, for some reason I'm not sure how to say this...#$b#... What do you think of @? You know, do you think maybe they like me?#$b#I mean, as more than a friend...",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.6": "Sam, I have better things to do than talk about relationships with you...", //SebSneer
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.7.female": "C'mon, Seb... I just can't stop thinking about her.#$b#I dunno, it's weird, I've never felt like this about anyone before.#$b#I just want to be close to her all the time.$l#$b#And you remember that movie night, right? Oh... and at Pierre's... I still dream about how that felt.$l",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.7.male": "C'mon, Seb... I just can't stop thinking about him.#$b#I dunno, it's weird, I've never felt like this about anyone before.#$b#I just want to be close to him all the time.$l#$b#And you remember that movie night, right? Oh... and at Pierre's... I still dream about how that felt.$l",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.7.neutral": "C'mon, Seb... I just can't stop thinking about them.#$b#I dunno, it's weird, I've never felt like this about anyone before.#$b#I just want to be close to them all the time.$l#$b#You remember that movie night, right? Oh... and at Pierre's... I still dream about how that felt.$l",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.7.1": "Ugh... seriously?",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.8": "You do realize who you're asking, right? I'm the last person who could help you with this kind of crap.#$b#... You should talk to Abby.",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.9.female": "*sighs* Okay fine... yeah of course I think @ is attractive, I mean I'm not blind... she's definitely got the brains to go with the looks too.#$b#... I've noticed she stares at you sometimes, talks to you a lot, and always sits next to you when we're playing Solarion Chronicles so you might have a shot.#$b#Don't even think about asking me to get involved, we're not in high school.#$b#Speaking of Solarion Chronicles... what exactly is going on with Thorak and {{CharacterName}} anyway?", //SebSus
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.9.male": "*sighs* Okay fine... yeah of course I think @ is attractive, I mean I'm not blind... he's definitely got the brains to go with the looks too.#$b#... I've noticed he stares at you sometimes, talks to you a lot, and always sits next to you when we're playing Solarion Chronicles so you might have a shot.#$b#Don't even think about asking me to get involved, we're not in high school.#$b#Speaking of Solarion Chronicles... what exactly is going on with Thorak and {{CharacterName}} anyway?",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.9.neutral": "*sighs* Okay fine... yeah of course I think @ is attractive, I mean I'm not blind... they've definitely got the brains to go with the looks too.#$b#... I've noticed she stares at you sometimes, talks to you a lot, and always sits next to you when we're playing Solarion Chronicles so you might have a shot.#$b#Don't even think about asking me to get involved, we're not in high school.#$b#Speaking of Solarion Chronicles... what exactly is going on with Thorak and {{CharacterName}} anyway?",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.10.female": "Oh uh... nothing? Heh. I really care about what @ thinks of me... I don't wanna look like an idiot, y'know?#$b#At first, I just noticed how beautiful she is, but as we became friends, I started to notice other things...#$b#... like how she's so smart and resourceful. She's also very funny and sometimes sarcastic, kinda like you only she talks more...$l#$b#I want to know everything about @... favorite foods, movies, games... And I really REALLY want to hold her, kiss her, y'know, ma--$l",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.10.male": "Oh uh... nothing? Heh. I really care about what @ thinks of me... I don't wanna look like an idiot, y'know?#$b#At first, I just noticed how good looking he is, but as we became friends, I started to notice other things...#$b#... like how he's so smart and resourceful. He's also very funny and sometimes sarcastic, kinda like you only he talks more...$l#$b#I want to know everything about @... favorite foods, movies, games... And I really REALLY want to--$l",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.10.neutral": "Oh uh... nothing? Heh. I really care about what @ thinks of me... I don't wanna look like an idiot, y'know?#$b#At first, I just noticed how good looking they are, but as we became friends, I started to notice other things...#$b#... like how they're so smart and resourceful. They're also very funny and sometimes sarcastic, kinda like you only they talk more...$l#$b#I want to know everything about @... favorite foods, movies, games... And I really REALLY want to--$l",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.11": "WOAH! You can stop right there, I'm not an idiot, I know what you're going to say.#$b#If you were anyone else, I'd blow it off I've never seen you all hot and bothered like this before. You're... really serious, aren't you? Huh...$7#$b#I guess... if it were me... and considering you're not the type to screw around...#$b#Keep talking and hanging out, if @ feels the same way, it should all work out naturally. Don't force it or you might end up crushed. Make sure it's real.",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.12": "Yeah, you're right... Damn, I hope it works out. Just... GAAHH!! I hate waiting!$s",
		"sam.event.Lovestruck.13": "Pfft... don't hurt yourself...", //SebSmirk

	//Narrow Escape //core version for DSV
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.1": "Ohhhh you weren't kidding, it really is dark and creepy down here...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.2": "Last time, we saw a giant... something... over there in that murky water.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.3": "Yeah, it was HUGE, none of us had any weapons so we had to run for it.$s#$b#Some of us having a stronger sense of self-preservation than others.$a",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.4": "Shut up, Sam, you were warned.$a",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.5": "Fine, but you're back to being bait.$a",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.6": "Pffttt... @, is it always like this on your adventures? It's a wonder you find anything!$h#$b#It seems you're all lacking in the leadership department. Good thing I came this time, and brought my sword.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.7": "SHUSH!! Jeez... like bringing a gang of hyenas...$a",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.8": "Uh... guys...$8",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.9": "I am not being loud, you can blame Sam for that. So what was your plan?$a",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.10": "Last I heard, you were the self-proclaimed leader. So lead on.$10",  //Seb add portrait calls
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.11": "Guys... there's something...$8",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.12": "Ugh, fine! How about we split into two teams. Since we're the only competent ones here, we each take an accident-prone minion.$h",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.13": "That's a stupid-$a",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.14": "Seb! Behind you!!$8",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.15.first": "Damn! That is one large amphibian!#Sam ducks back into a corner, and I follow... there's barely enough room for two...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.15.third": "That is one large amphibian... Sam ducks back into a corner, there's barely enough room for two...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.16": "SEE?? I TOLD YOU, ABBY!!$13", //Seb add portrait calls
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.17.shy.female.first": "Ooof... Seb... I can barely breathe and I'm completely squashed against Sam, my rear pressed against his pelvis, his heavy breath on my ear...#I try to shift and give him more room, but only succeed in rubbing against him as he sucks in a sharp breath... Sorry, Sam...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.17.shy.male.first": "Ooof... Seb... I can barely breathe and I'm completely squashed against Sam, my rear pressed against his pelvis, his heavy breath on my ear...#I try to shift and give him more room, but only succeed in rubbing against him as he sucks in a sharp breath... Sorry, Sam...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.17.shy.neutral.first": "Ooof... Seb... I can barely breathe and I'm completely squashed against Sam, my rear pressed against his pelvis, his heavy breath on my ear...#I try to shift and give him more room... Sorry, Sam...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.17.shy.female.third": "Seb shoves himself into the corner, crushing {{farmerName}} against Sam, her rear pressed against his pelvis, his heavy breath on her ear... {{farmerName}} tries to shift and give Sam more room, but only succeeds in rubbing against him as he sucks in a sharp breath... Sorry, Sam...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.17.shy.male.third": "Seb shoves himself into the corner, crushing {{farmerName}} against Sam, his rear pressed against Sam's pelvis, heavy breath on his ear... {{farmerName}} tries to shift and give Sam more room, but only succeeds in rubbing against him as he sucks in a sharp breath... Sorry, Sam...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.17.shy.neutral.third": "Seb shoves himself into the corner, crushing {{farmerName}} against Sam, their rear pressed against his pelvis, his heavy breath on their ear... {{farmerName}} tries to shift and give Sam more room... Sorry, Sam...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.17.flirt.female.first": "Ooof... Seb... I can barely breathe and I'm completely squashed against Sam, my rear pressed against his pelvis, his heavy breath on my ear...#I try to shift and give him more room, but only succeed in rubbing against him as he sucks in a sharp breath... Sorry, Sam...#Butterflies tap dance in my gut as all I can think about is Sam's body warm on my back.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.17.flirt.male.first": "Ooof... Seb... I can barely breathe and I'm completely squashed against Sam, my rear pressed against his pelvis, his heavy breath on my ear...#I try to shift and give him more room, but only succeed in rubbing against him as he sucks in a sharp breath... Sorry, Sam...#I feel the telltale twitch in my crotch as all I can think about is Sam's body warm on my back.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.17.flirt.neutral.first": "Ooof... Seb... I can barely breathe and I'm completely squashed against Sam, my rear pressed against his pelvis, his heavy breath on my ear...#I try to shift and give him more room, but only succeed in rubbing against him as he sucks in a sharp breath... Sorry, Sam...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.17.flirt.female.third": "Seb shoves himself into the corner, crushing {{farmerName}} against Sam, her rear pressed against his pelvis, his heavy breath on her ear... {{farmerName}} tries to shift and give Sam more room, but only succeeds in rubbing against him as he sucks in a sharp breath...#Butterflies tap dance in her gut as all she can think about is Sam's body warm on her back.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.17.flirt.male.third": "Seb shoves himself into the corner, crushing {{farmerName}} against Sam, his rear pressed against Sam's pelvis, heavy breath on his ear... {{farmerName}} tries to shift and give Sam more room, but only succeeds in rubbing against him as he sucks in a sharp breath...#{{farmerName}} feels the telltale twitch in his crotch as all he can think about is Sam's body warm on his back.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.17.flirt.neutral.third": "Seb shoves himself into the corner, crushing {{farmerName}} against Sam, their rear pressed against his pelvis, his heavy breath on their ear... {{farmerName}} tries to shift and give Sam more room, but only succeeds in rubbing against him as he sucks in a sharp breath...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.18": "I-it's okay, you're not uh... you're not hurting me...$l#$b#Uhhh Seb... can't you find another hiding spot-$s",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.19.first": "Purple hair and an arm in my face... Abby!!#She shoves in on my other side, wedging me firmly in place...#Sam grunts in my ear, reflexively gripping my hips... Oh Yoba... I can feel him squirming, but there's nowhere to go, his hands now trapped with his fingers in my hip creases...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.19.third": "Purple hair and an arm in {{farmerName}}'s face... Abby shoves in on the other side, wedging herself firmly in place...#Sam grunts in {{farmerName}}'s ear, squirming, but there's nowhere to go, completely trapped in the dark.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.20": "Is it... is it gone? Seb, go check.$7",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.21": "Yes, ma'am...$a",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.22": "Hey, be nice or I won't bring you next time.$a",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.23": "What?? This is not your expedition, Abby!$a",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.24": "Seb... please get out!$s",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.25": "Oh wow, how'd you end up back in the corner like that? Damn!$7",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.25.1": "All clear... I'm heading out. You guys can do what you want.$10",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.26": "Well, I guess that's all the excitement we're getting for now...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.27.female.first": "Phew! Danger and tension gone, I start to move, slipping on some loose rocks and sliding down Sam's front... he desperately grabs me, his arms around my breasts.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.27.male.first": "Phew! Danger and tension gone, I start to move, slipping on some loose rocks and sliding down Sam's front... he desperately grabs me, his arms around my waist.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.27.neutral.first": "Phew! Danger and tension gone, I start to move, slipping on some loose rocks and sliding down Sam's front... he desperately grabs me, his arms around my waist.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.27.female.third": "Danger and tension gone, {{farmerName}} starts to move, slipping on some loose rocks and sliding down Sam's front... he desperately grabs her, his arms around her breasts.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.27.male.third": "Danger and tension gone, {{farmerName}} starts to move, slipping on some loose rocks and sliding down Sam's front, he desperately grabs him, his arms around @'s waist.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.27.neutral.third": "Danger and tension gone, {{farmerName}} starts to move, slipping on some loose rocks and sliding down Sam's front, he desperately grabs them, his arms around their waist.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.28.first": "What was that?? A grinding sound... Sam yelps, air rushing up from below... falling... darkness...#Ooof! An instant later and I'm back in Sam's arms at the bottom of a passage... or cave.#It's completely black... dripping sounds... echos... where are we??",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.28.third": "A grinding sound... Sam yelps, air rushing up from below... falling... darkness...#An instant later and {{farmerName}} is back in Sam's arms at the bottom of a passage... or cave.#It's completely black... dripping sounds... echos... where is this??",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.29": "Are you okay? Ohhh fu-- *groans*$s",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.30": "Yeah... I'm okay, not hurt anyway. Just a uh... personal problem.$l",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.31.shy.first": "I feel him hard against my back... holy Yoba... I better move off the poor guy...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.31.shy.third": "Sam shifts back, trying to hide his obviously awkward situation...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.31.flirt.first": "I feel him hard against my back... holy Yoba... electricity shoots through my core...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.31.flirt.third": "Sam shifts back, trying to hide his obviously awkward situation...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.32": "@... I'm so sorry... I uh... dammit...$l",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.33.first": "He releases his arms, the air feels suddenly cold against my chest...#Regaining my footing, I grab his hand and help him up.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.33.third": "He releases his arms, the air feels suddenly cold...#{{farmerName}} struggles up and reaches to grip Sam's hand and help him stand.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.34": "Thanks... Uh, give me just a sec.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.35.first": "Sam rustles around in the darkness, I can only assume he's making some necessary adjustments.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.35.third": "Sam rustles around in the darkness, {{farmerName}} can only assume he's making some necessary adjustments.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.36": "I can barely see anything... it's a little lighter that way, maybe this is a tunnel?#$b#I don't think we can get back up where we were, the trapdoor closed and there's no ladder... Or maybe this was the ladder, there's some wood pieces here.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.37.first": "Groping around, I feel some rough wooden planks... definitely not repairable, it crumbles in my hands. Rotten.#Sam's fingers graze my arm...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.37.third": "Groping around, {{farmerName}} feels some rough wooden planks... definitely not repairable, it crumbles away. Rotten.#Sam reaches out...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.38": "I'm really sorry about all this... is it okay if I hang on to you? I can't see crap and I've crashed and burned enough for one day.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.39": "Take Sam's hand.", //option1
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.40": "Take Sam's arm and pull him close.", //option2 //flag MaggSamTakeArm
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.41": "Okay, but keep your wandering hands to a minimum.", //option3
		//TakeHisArm
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.42": "...$l#$b#*whispers* I'm glad you're not mad about earlier...$l", //response2
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.43.shy.first": "Sam's body heat is comforting in this place... He draws a shaky breath, squeezing my fingers.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.43.shy.third": "Sam's body heat is comforting in this place... He draws a shaky breath, squeezing {{farmerName}}'s fingers.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.43.flirt.first": "Sam's body heat is comforting in this place... turning, I lean on his shoulder, squeezing his fingers... He draws a shaky breath.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.43.flirt.third": "Sam's body heat is comforting in this place... turning, {{farmerName}} leans on his shoulder, squeezing his fingers... He draws a shaky breath.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.44": "I'm glad you're here with me... I don't really like being alone.$s#$b#And... well... things are always better when you're there.$l",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.45": "Let's see if we can get out of here... I'm not a huge sewer fan, heh heh!$10#$b#I guess... follow the light?",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.46.first": "I don't have any better ideas, so we stumble toward the slightly grayer light ahead.#I'd rather avoid touching the walls, but we need to stay oriented so I trail my fingertips along the cold stone.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.46.third": "Without any better ideas, they stumble toward the slightly grayer light ahead.#{{farmerName}} would rather avoid touching the walls, but it's necessary to stay oriented in the dark, trailing fingertips along the cold stone.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.47.shy.female.first": "OH! Nasty! Something slimy and wet touches my fingers, just algae but yuck!#Snatching my hand from the wall, I wipe the goop off on my pants, then realize I've let go of Sam...#I hear his feet on the stone and grope for him, finding the edge of his jacket.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.47.shy.male.first": "Oh gross... Something slimy and wet touches my fingers, just algae but ugh...#Snatching my hand from the wall, I wipe the goop off on my pants, then realize I've let go of Sam...#I hear his feet on the stone and grope for him, finding the edge of his jacket.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.47.shy.neutral.first": "Oh gross... Something slimy and wet touches my fingers, just algae but yuck!#Snatching my hand from the wall, I wipe the goop off on my pants, then realize I've let go of Sam...#I hear his feet on the stone and grope for him, finding the edge of his jacket.",
