		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.47.shy.male.third": "Something slimy and wet touches {{farmerName}}'s fingers, just algae but he snatches his hand from the wall, wiping the goop off on his pants.#He loses track of Sam in the dark...#His feet scuff the stone and {{farmerName}} gropes for him, finding the edge of his jacket.",
