		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.47.flirt.female.first": "OH! Nasty! Something slimy and wet touches my fingers, just algae but yuck!#Snatching my hand from the wall, I wipe the goop off on my pants, then realize I've let go of Sam...#I hear his feet on the stone and grope for him, finding the edge of his jacket and... hmm, not his arm... oh heck, now I have my hand on his ass.#He really has a nice, firm rear...",
