		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.47.flirt.neutral.third": "Something slimy and wet touches {{farmerName}}'s fingers, just algae but they snatch their hand from the wall, wiping the goop off on their pants.#They lose track of Sam in the dark...#His feet scuff the stone and {{farmerName}} gropes for him, finding the edge of his jacket and... accidentally brushes their hand over his ass.#He really has a nice, firm rear...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.48": "Heh! Uh... thanks! Pfftt... Benefits of skating, I guess. And you have REALLY great-$l#$b#What's that?? There's a shadow over there... not a frog... it looked like a guy!$8",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.49.first": "Time to stop messing around and get out.#That looks like real sunlight, a grate? I grab Sam's hand and we make a run for it, stumbling and bumping into each other until we reach the end of the tunnel.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.49.third": "Time to stop messing around and get out.#That looks like real sunlight, a grate? {{farmerName}} grabs Sam's hand and they make a run for it, stumbling and bumping into each other until they reach the end of the tunnel.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.50": "Thank Yoba!! Okay, now to put my lock-picking skills to the test...", //need focused portrait
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.51.first": "Lock-picking skills? Now that's interesting! I watch as Sam skillfully twirls a pick in the lock, eventually hitting the right pin and releasing the mechanism.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.51.third": "Lock-picking skills? Now that's interesting! {{farmerName}} watches as Sam skillfully twirls a pick in the lock, eventually hitting the right pin and releasing the mechanism.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.52": "There, got it! C'mon, let's find Seb and Abby, I bet they're wondering what happened to us...#$b#But before we go back to the surface...$l",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.53.shy.female.first": "The air ripples and I feel Sam's arms around me, holding me tight... his lips brushing--#Blinking, my vision clears and Sam is staring at me, I must have been hallucinating... what is in the air down here anyway??",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.53.shy.male.first": "The air ripples and I feel Sam's arms around me, holding me tight... his lips brushing--#Blinking, my vision clears and Sam is staring at me, I must have been hallucinating... what is in the air down here anyway??",
