		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.53.shy.male.third": "The air ripples and {{farmerName}} feels Sam's arms around him, holding him tight... his lips brushing--#Blinking, his vision clears and Sam is staring, he must have been hallucinating... what is in the air down here anyway??",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.53.shy.neutral.third": "The air ripples and {{farmerName}} feels Sam's arms around them, holding them tight... his lips brushing--#Blinking, {{farmerName}}'s vision clears and Sam is staring, they must have been hallucinating... what is in the air down here anyway??",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.53.flirt.female.first": "The air ripples and I feel Sam's arms tight around me, full lips pressed hard to mine, Sam softly moans as I tangle my fingers in the back of his hair...#Blinking, my vision clears and Sam is staring at me, I must have been hallucinating... what is in the air down here anyway??",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.53.flirt.male.first": "The air ripples and I feel Sam's arms tight around me, full lips pressed hard to mine, Sam softly moans as I tangle my fingers in the back of his hair...#Blinking, my vision clears and Sam is staring at me, I must have been hallucinating... what is in the air down here anyway??",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.53.flirt.neutral.first": "The air ripples and I feel Sam's arms tight around me, full lips pressed hard to mine, Sam softly moans as I tangle my fingers in the back of his hair...#Blinking, my vision clears and Sam is staring at me, I must have been hallucinating... what is in the air down here anyway??",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.53.flirt.female.third": "The air ripples and {{farmerName}} feels Sam's arms tight around her, full lips pressed hard to hers as she tangles her fingers in the back of his hair...#Blinking, {{farmerName}}'s vision clears and Sam is staring, she must have been hallucinating... what is in the air down here anyway??",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.53.flirt.male.third": "The air ripples and {{farmerName}} feels Sam's arms tight around him, full lips pressed hard to his as {{farmerName}} tangles his fingers in the back of Sam's hair...#Blinking, his vision clears and Sam is staring, he must have been hallucinating... what is in the air down here anyway??",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.53.flirt.neutral.third": "The air ripples and {{farmerName}} feels Sam's arms tight around them, full lips pressed hard to theirs as they tangles their fingers in the back of his hair...#Blinking, {{farmerName}}'s vision clears and Sam is staring, they must have been hallucinating... what is in the air down here anyway??",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.54": "C'mon, something weird's going on... let's get out of here!$s",
		//No Branch option 1 or 3
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.55": "Thanks... Let's try down that way.", //response1
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.56": "No worries, really, seems like I'm cursed or something.$s", //response3
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.57.first": "We stumble through the eerie darkness, not much seems to be down here, at least nothing we can see or hear...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.57.third": "They stumble through the eerie darkness, not much seems to be down here, at least nothing they can see or hear...",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.58": "Look! I see some light over there, is that a grate or something?#$b#Wait, what's that?? There's a shadow over there... not a frog... it looked like a guy!$8",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.59.first": "Time to get out of here... we make a run for it, stumbling and bumping into each other until we reach the end of the tunnel.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.59.third": "Time to get out of here... the two of them make a run for it, stumbling and bumping into each other until they reach the end of the tunnel.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.60": "Thank Yoba!! Okay, now to put my lock-picking skills to the test...", //need focused portrait
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.61": "Lock-picking skills? Now that's interesting!",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.62": "There, got it! C'mon, let's find Seb and Abby, I bet they're wondering what happened to us.",
		//warp to town all branches
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.63": "Look, I'm sure they're fine, my dad is going to flip if he finds out I was down there!",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.64": "Good to know you're gonna abandon them to save your own ass...$s#$b#Fine, I'm going back to see if I find anything.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.65": "Hey! That's not fair! You've seen how my dad is.$7#$b#Ugh... alright, I'll come. But only because you guilted me into it. I'm sure they can get out on their own.$a",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.66": "Sam! @! Where were you? Are you oka- WOW!! You guys STINK! Like an entirely new category of stench!$7",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.67": "What happened anyway? I swear, you were there, then you just disappeared.$10",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.68": "And you better not have been making out or something, I was worried!$a",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.69": "Uh huh... worried about getting busted.$11",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.70": "Shut up, Seb. Well, since you're both alive and whole... from what I can tell... I'm gonna get back to my homework.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.71": "Yeah, gotta finish some coding. Come by later and fill me in, after you've both showered.$7",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.72": "Time to get cleaned up, I guess...$10#$b#OH! Sorry, sorta spaced out there for a sec.$l#$b#Anyway, that was actually fun, like a real adventure.$h",
		//end
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.73.first": "Definitely time for a bath and fresh clothes... and a lot of laundry soap. Maybe I'll see Sam later.", //option 1 3 end
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.73.third": "Definitely time for a bath and fresh clothes... and a lot of laundry soap.",
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.74.first": "Definitely time for a bath and fresh clothes... and a lot of laundry soap.#Damn, it sure would be a fun adventure sharing a shower with Sam...", //option2 end
		"sam.event.NarrowEscape.74.third": "Definitely time for a bath and fresh clothes... and a lot of laundry soap.#{{farmerName}} looks away, imagining a fun adventure sharing a shower with Sam...",

	//On the Flip Side
		"sam.event.FlipSide.1": "Hey, hang out and take a break if you want, Sam's not here if you're looking for him.$7",
		"sam.event.FlipSide.2": "Well, I just assumed you'd be... erm... I mean, you spend a lot of time together. I only noticed because he's not in my room as often.$7",
		"sam.event.FlipSide.3.first": "Wait... does Seb think we're... 'together' together?",
		"sam.event.FlipSide.3.third": "{{farmerName}} pauses, suddenly wondering if Sebastian has the wrong idea.",
		"sam.event.FlipSide.4": "Oh! Well, no, Sam would be over the moon if you guys were dating... Um, forget I said that.$s#$b#Anyway, I was about to make some coffee, do you want a cup?",
		"sam.event.FlipSide.5": "If you want my opinion, you and Sam are good together. He can get wired sometimes, but he's a lot calmer around you.$7#$b#The funny thing is he acts confident, but he's afraid he'll disappoint you, or you're not serious about him... something along that line.",
		"sam.event.FlipSide.6": "I wonder why Sam would think that...", //question
		"sam.event.FlipSide.7": "Did I do something wrong?", //option1
		"sam.event.FlipSide.8": "I don't want to risk our friendship.", //option2
		"sam.event.FlipSide.9": "I really want to be with him...", //option3
		"sam.event.FlipSide.10": "No, nothing like that. He just... needs positive reinforcement.$h#$b#He's great at dishing out the compliments, but has a hard time believing he deserves any himself.#$b#Besides... if you aren't sure how he feels, you've been working way too hard and need a long vacation.$h", //response1
		"sam.event.FlipSide.11": "I get that, but if you decide to take a chance with him, just know you can trust him.#$b#He's never been anything but honest and straightforward as long as I've known him.$7#$b#Besides... if you really think you're just friends, you need to visit Harvey because you must have hit your head.$h", //response2
		"sam.event.FlipSide.12": "Yeah, I know. I wasn't kidding when I said you two are good together. Just treat each other right and it'll work out.#$b#Besides, you two are wound so tight, the air vibrates with the tension. I can't believe you haven't... uh, sorry.$l", //response3
		"sam.event.FlipSide.13.shy": "But seriously, if you do end up together, Sam would never betray you for anyone else.#$b#He's pulled me out of some really dark places... he truly cares about people... particularly you.$h",
		"sam.event.FlipSide.13.flirt": "But seriously, if you do end up together, Sam would never betray you for anyone else. He's pulled me out of some really dark places... he truly cares about people.#$b#And my mom will be happy to make you a new bed in case you need one after you finally... *snorts*", //SebSmirk
		"sam.event.FlipSide.14": "How's the coffee?",

	//Moving Forward
		"sam.event.movingforward.1": "I guess I'm not usually quiet, huh.$s#$b#I've just been thinking... about the future. I haven't slowed down long enough to really consider what I'm going to do with my life, but now...$s",
		"sam.event.movingforward.2": "Now there are things I want... Reasons to improve myself, start paying attention and make goals.#$b#It's hard though, like trying to cross a bridge when the middle is missing. I know where I am, and where I want to be, but I have no idea how to get there.$9",
		"sam.event.movingforward.2.1": "*Sigh...*",
		"sam.event.movingforward.3": "Sometimes... I think there's no point in trying, I can't do anything useful, just play guitar and... well... I guess that's it.$s",
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.1": "This is not like Sam at all...", //question
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.2": "Take his hand...", //option1
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.3": "Give him a hug...", //option2
		//takehand
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.first": "Sam, you know that's not true. You're brilliant on the guitar, and you write song lyrics and music yourself.#You take great care of your little brother, and you're an amazing friend.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.third": "{{farmerName}} sighs, then reminds Sam of his skills playing the guitar, writing song lyrics and music, along with caring for his little brother, and supporting his friends.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.4.first": "Sam squeezes my fingers tight, rubbing them with his thumbs. The calluses on his hands feel rough, but comforting.#He stares at our hands for a moment, his lips slightly parted before he takes a deep breath, smiling...",
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.4.third": "He takes {{farmerName}}'s hand in his, staring at them for a moment before he takes a deep breath, smiling...",
		"sam.event.movingforward.5": "Thanks, I really appreciate that... but how do I make a career out of music? People are watching our videos... and I've gotten some feedback.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.6.first": "Maybe... ask at the music store in Zuzu? They have live music there sometimes. You could find out how to get on their schedule.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.6.third": "{{farmerName}} thinks for a moment, then suggests asking at the music store in Zuzu. They have live music there and the band might be able to get on their schedule.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.7": "That's a good idea, I was planning to go there soon anyway, need more guitar picks.$3",
		"sam.event.movingforward.8": "Do you want to come along? I can show you some cool things at the store, and we could get lunch in Zuzu.$l",
		//hugtight //flag MaggSamHugTight
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.5.female.first": "Before I think better of it, I wrap my arms around him, and he immediately clasps me tight against his chest, his face buried in my hair and neck.#His breath shaky, he fights to maintain some semblance of control.#Sam, you've worked so hard to become an incredible musician, writing your own music and lyrics, and always spending time with your family and friends.#You're so important to me...",
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.5.male.first": "Before I think better of it, I wrap my arms around him, and he immediately clasps me tight against his chest, his face buried in my neck.#Sam, you've worked so hard to become an incredible musician, writing your own music and lyrics, and always spending time with your family and friends.#You're so important to me...",
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.5.neutral.first": "Before I think better of it, I wrap my arms around him, and he immediately clasps me tight against his chest, his face buried in my neck.#Sam, you've worked so hard to become an incredible musician, writing your own music and lyrics, and always spending time with your family and friends.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.5.female.third": "{{farmerName}} wraps her arms around him, and he immediately clasps her tight against his chest, his face buried in her neck.#She whispers in his ear, reminding him of his skills playing the guitar, writing song lyrics and music, along with caring for his little brother, and supporting his friends",
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.5.male.third": "{{farmerName}} wraps his arms around the lean young man, and Sam immediately clasps him tight against his chest, face buried in the farmer's neck.#@ whispers in Sam's ear, reminding him of his skills playing the guitar, writing song lyrics and music, along with caring for his little brother, and supporting his friends",
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.5.neutral.third": "{{farmerName}} wraps their arms around him, and he immediately clasps them tight against his chest, his face buried in their neck.#@ whispers in his ear, reminding him of his skills playing the guitar, writing song lyrics and music, along with caring for his little brother, and supporting his friends",
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.6.first": "We stand like that for a few moments... or it might have been an eternity... just feeling each other breathe...",
		"sam.event.movingforward.4.6.third": "They stand like that for a few moments... or it might have been an eternity... just feeling each other breathe...",
		"sam.event.movingforward.5.1": "@... th-thanks... I want to be the best I can for you... you're my motivation, my new reason for moving forward...$l",
		"sam.event.movingforward.5.2.female.first": "Sam's warm lips touch my neck in a soft kiss... my breath catches, heart racing...#He relaxes his grip, leaning back slightly to rest his forehead against mine.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.5.2.male.first": "Sam's warm lips brush my neck... my breath catches, heart racing...#He relaxes his grip, leaning back slightly to rest his forehead against mine.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.5.2.female.third": "Sam softly kisses {{farmerName}}'s neck before relaxing his grip, reluctantly dropping his arms and stepping back.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.5.2.male.third": "Sam's lips lightly brush {{farmerName}}'s neck before he relaxes his grip, reluctantly dropping his arms and stepping back.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.5.3": "I... um... I'm just not sure what to do next...$s",
		"sam.event.movingforward.6.1.first": "Maybe... ask at the music store in Zuzu? They have live music there sometimes. You could find out how to get on their schedule.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.6.1.third": "{{farmerName}} thinks for a moment, then suggests asking at the music store in Zuzu. They have live music there and the band might be able to get on their schedule.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.7.1": "Hmm... That's a good idea, I was planning to go there soon anyway to get more guitar picks.$3",
		"sam.event.movingforward.8.1": "Do you want to come along? I can show you some cool things at the store, and we could get lunch in Zuzu. Kind of... like a real date?$l",
		"sam.event.movingforward.9.first": "Yes, that sounds perfect... it's a date.",
		"sam.event.movingforward.9.third": "Smiling, {{farmerName}} agrees... it's a date.",

	//Music Man
		"sam.event.MusicMan.1.1": "Ready to head out? The music store is calling, haha!$h",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.1.2": "Hey, whoever that is, they're really good!$h",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.2": "Wait... is that...$8",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.3": "OHMYGOD OHMYGOD OHMYGOD!!! Do you know who that is???$8",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.4": "He's Luca! Remember, the guy I told you about, the mixed martial arts fighter?#$b#Well, he's not doing that anymore but he's also a drummer and he's been touring with a hot band and... and... *GASP*$8",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.5.first": "Sam! Breathe! You can't get his autograph if you pass out, pffttt...",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.5.third": "Sam is practically hyperventilating, {{farmerName}} grabs his arm to calm him down.",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.6": "Hey there! I'll be right with ya, sorry, I didn't hear the door.$1",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.7": "How can I help ya? I'm watchin' the shop fer my friend, 'been real quiet so thought I'd get a bit o' practice in.",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.8": "H-hi! Um... Hi, you're Lone Wolf Luca! R-right? I mean, I watched all your fights, you're the best! I was kinda sad when you quit, but then you started touring and I'm a musician too and it's so awesome you play drums, amazing! And... and... *GASP* Can I get your autograph?$10",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.9": "Well, sure! Don' go by Lone Wolf no more, but I can sign this album fer ya.$1",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.10": "There y'are, nice ta meet ya...",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.11": "I'm Sam! And this is @!$h",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.12": "Glad ta know ya, Sam and @. You said yer a musician?",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.13": "Yeah! Guitar... drums, keyboard... I can play most any instrument, but guitar is my favorite.#$b#@ plays the hand harp and my friend Seb is a genius on the synth.$h",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.14": "Sounds like you've got yerselves a band there, jus' short a drummer!$1#$b#I'm usually at the shop on Sundays, next time yer in town, bring yer guitar and we'll play a set.",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.15": "Wow, really? You got it!$h",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.16": "Oh yeah, guitar picks! Can't forget why we came in the first place.$10",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.17": "I still can't believe we ran into Luca and he was so cool!$h#$b#But... now let's spend the day together like we planned.$l",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.18": "This is a nice spot... what do you think?",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.19": "Oh yeah, I forgot to tell you about the videos we loaded on that music site. They've been getting a lot of views and comments, mostly positive.#$b#It's cool to have supporters, even if they're just anonymous internet fans.$h#$b#Some of the stuff they say about Seb, though, damn!#$b#I'll never tell him, he'd die of embarrassment and never let me load another video.",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.19.1": "Obviously the fans think Seb's dark edgy vibe is super hot.", //question
		"sam.event.MusicMan.19.2": "That's great, you're getting popular!", //option1
		"sam.event.MusicMan.19.3": "Are there comments about you?", //option2
		"sam.event.MusicMan.19.4": "Yeah! I still don't know if we'll make any money at it, but at least we're getting good feedback.$h",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.20": "Uh, well, there's a few but mostly just goofy stuff, nothing like the ones about Seb.$l#$b#Besides... I really only care what you, my family, and friends think of me, not random people.$l", //sam 60 farmer 32
		"sam.event.MusicMan.21": "I've been doing some research too, I've found a few interesting career possibilities.#$b#Like music therapy, recording for movies and shows, or just taking gigs like what we did in Zuzu City.#$b#*sighs* I'm not real big on the gig idea, I want something more stable.$s",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.22": "Ugh, none of those ideas sound like anything that would pan out.$s#$b#I guess I need to grow up, give up music, and find a regular job.$s",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.23": "Wh-what do you think?", //question null
		"sam.event.MusicMan.24": "Music isn't just a job, it's part of you. Don't give up yet.", //option1
		"sam.event.MusicMan.25": "Growing up isn't just about having a career, it's being the person you want to be.", //option2
		"sam.event.MusicMan.26": "You're right. I'm just afraid of failing, disappointing my family. And you.$s",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.27.shy.first": "Shadows start to cloud his bright eyes. I take his hands in mine.#'I'm here to back you up, no matter what you decide.'",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.27.shy.third": "Shadows start to cloud his bright eyes. {{farmerName}} takes his hands...",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.27.flirt.first": "Shadows start to cloud his bright eyes. I take his hands, tracing the length of his fingers with mine.#'I'm here to back you up, no matter what you decide.'",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.27.flirt.third": "Shadows start to cloud his bright eyes. {{farmerName}} takes his hands, tracing the length of his fingers.",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.27.sassy.first": "Shadows start to cloud his bright eyes. I take his hands, tracing the length of his fingers then pressing them to my lips.#'I'm here to back you up, no matter what you decide. Sam, I really care about you.'",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.27.sassy.third": "Shadows start to cloud his bright eyes. {{farmerName}} takes his hands, tracing the length of his fingers, then softly kissing them.",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.28.shy": "Okay. I might not find a good job right away, but I CAN work on being the man I want to be.",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.28.flirt": "Yeah, you're right. I might not find a good job right away, but I CAN work on being the man I want to be.#$b#@, I... um...$l",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.28.sassy": "Yeah, you're right. I might not find a good job right away, but I CAN work on being the man I want to be.#$b#@, I... I care about you more than I can say... I--$l",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.29": "A band sets up and starts playing music near the fountain.", //question
		"sam.event.MusicMan.30": "Ask Sam to dance.", //option 1
		"sam.event.MusicMan.31": "Listen to the music together.", //option 2
		//Dance
		"sam.event.MusicMan.32": "Wh-what? Haha! Sure, I'll dance with you.$l",
		//End
		"sam.event.MusicMan.33": "I think this has been the best date I've ever had... well, to be perfectly honest, it's the only date I've ever been on. But it sure sets the bar high!$h", //sam 60
		"sam.event.MusicMan.34": "Really I've only ever wanted to go out with you... I guess I'm not the kind of guy who thinks bragging about all the people he's been with is cool.#$b#That just seems stupid and pointless, how will anyone trust you if you can't commit? *shrugs*#$b#I dunno, I'd rather be with one person I love than dozens I don't care about.$l",
		"sam.event.MusicMan.35": "Sam smiles, then glances away.", //question
		"sam.event.MusicMan.36": "That's cool, I feel the same.", //option1
		"sam.event.MusicMan.37": "That depends on how you define love and trust.", //option2
		"sam.event.MusicMan.38": "That's a very limited view.", //option3
		"sam.event.MusicMan.39": "Really? A lot of people would disagree, but I'm glad you feel the same way.$l#$b#Um... I'm really glad you came with me, let's do that again soon, okay?$h", //flag MaggSamCommit
		"sam.event.MusicMan.40": "Maybe... but I like to keep things simple, y'know, less drama that way.#$b#Um... I'm really glad you came with me, let's do that again soon, okay?$h", //flag MaggSamUnsure
		"sam.event.MusicMan.41": "Huh. Maybe, but it's how I feel. *shrugs*#$b#I guess it's time to head home, thanks for coming!$h", //flag MaggSamNoCommit

	//Skate Dreams
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.1": "I was thinking about a skatepark and drew up some designs, what do you think?$h",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.2": "A ramp here, and rails for grinding, if we can, a wall would be great over on this side...$6",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.3": "You gotta have a halfpipe, so that can go here...$6",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.4.first": "Sam is so excited, his shoulder pressed against mine as he points out every detail on his drawing.#It’s very good actually, it would be easy for Robin to build.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.4.third": "Sam is so excited, his shoulder pressed against {{farmerName}}'s as he points out every detail on his drawing.#It’s very good actually, it would be easy for Robin to build.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.5.shy.first": "I listen to Sam's voice, a soothing low tenor... and watch the sparkle in his blue-green eyes.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.5.flirt.first": "I listen to Sam's voice, a soothing low tenor... and focus on the feeling of his arm pressed against mine and the sparkle in his blue-green eyes.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.5.sassy.first": "I listen to Sam's voice, a soothing low tenor... and focus on the feeling of his arm pressed against mine, the sparkle in his blue-green eyes...#After a moment, I lean my head on his shoulder, his breath ruffling my hair.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.5.shy.third": "{{farmerName}} listens to Sam's voice, a soothing low tenor... and watches the sparkle in his blue-green eyes.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.5.flirt.third": "{{farmerName}} listens to Sam's voice, a soothing low tenor... and focuses on the feeling of his arm pressed close and the sparkle in his blue-green eyes.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.5.sassy.third": "{{farmerName}} listens to Sam's voice, a soothing low tenor... and focuses on the feeling of his arm pressed close, the sparkle in his blue-green eyes...#{{farmerName}} leans on his shoulder, enjoying his proximity.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.6": "Sorry, I kinda got carried away there, this is just a dream really, no way I’d ever raise enough money to build this thing!$s",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.7": "OH! Um... Heheh!",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.7.1.shy.first": "He blushes as he steps back to give me space.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.7.1.flirt.first": "Neither of us moves, he pauses for a moment, then takes my hands in his.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.7.1.sassy.first": "Neither of us moves, he pauses for a moment, then takes my hands in his, gripping them tight.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.7.1.shy.third": "He blushes as he steps back to give {{farmerName}} space.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.7.1.flirt.third": "Neither of them move, he pauses for a moment, then takes {{farmerName}}'s hands in his.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.7.1.sassy.third": "Neither of them move, he pauses for a moment, then takes {{farmerName}}'s hands in his, gripping them tight.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.8": "@, thanks for encouraging me to do this, I never would have tried before.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.9": "You always work so hard but still find time to hang out with me.#$b#Oh, and Seb, Abby, Shane... pretty much everybody, but I hope... ahem.$l",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.10": "You’re really strong, y’know?#$b#Most people wouldn’t have the guts to leave a decent life and go somewhere totally new and start over.#$b#I really admire that about you.#$b#I feel like I can tell you anything and you don’t judge, and you’re not worried about what other people think of you either.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.11": "Thanks for being my friend... maybe more... just knowing you has made my life so much better.$l#$b#Wow, this is getting really sappy! Haha!$10#$b#Uh, here, you can keep this, I really don't need it.#$b#Since we're here, how about a snack or a round of Prairie King?$h",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.12.first": "He reluctantly releases my hands and I tuck the paper in my pocket... maybe I'll have a use for this someday.",
		"sam.event.SkateDreams.12.third": "Maybe these plans will come in handy someday.",

	//Wipeout done
		"sam.event.Wipeout.1": "Hey...",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.2": "OH SHIIIIIIIT!!$8",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.3.first": "WOAH!! A flash of blonde hair, the world spinning and OOOF! ...I blink... bright aquamarine eyes... Sam? Wow... Deja vous!",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.3.third": "A flash of blonde hair, the world spinning ...{{farmerName}} blinks... Deja vous!",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.4": "*breathless* Holy shit! Are you okay?! Phew that was a close one, the leaves cushioned my fall and I cushioned yours, haha!",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.4.1": "Um... @... I really want to stay here just like this but... we better get up before I do something inappropriate.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.5.first": "Sam's breath puffs on my lips, his heart beating against my chest...",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.5.third": "Sam's breath puffs against {{farmerName}}'s lips, their hearts beating together...",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.6.1": "Laugh, roll off and reach down to Sam.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.6.2": "Don't move.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.7.first": "Sam grins as he grips my hand...",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.7.third": "Sam grins as he grips {{farmerName}}'s hand...",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.shy.female.first": "Sam's fingers tangle in the hair at the back of my neck, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his forehead to mine, his arms tightening around me... he sighs...#I quickly get to my feet and offer my hand.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.shy.male.first": "Sam's fingers tangle in the hair at the back of my neck, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his forehead to mine, his arms tightening around me... he sighs...#I quickly get to my feet and offer my hand.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.shy.neutral.first": "Sam's fingers tangle in the hair at the back of my neck, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his forehead to mine, his arms tightening around me... he sighs...#I quickly get to my feet and offer my hand.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.shy.female.third": "Sam tangles his fingers in {{farmerName}}'s hair, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his forehead to hers... he sighs...#she quickly gets to her feet and offers Sam a hand up.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.shy.male.third": "Sam tangles his fingers in {{farmerName}}'s hair, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his forehead to theirs... he sighs...#{{farmerName}} quickly gets to his feet and offers Sam a hand up.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.shy.neutral.third": "Sam tangles his fingers in {{farmerName}}'s hair, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his forehead to {{farmerName}}'s... he sighs...#{{farmerName}} quickly gets to their feet and offers Sam a hand up.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.flirt.female.first": "Sam's fingers tangle in the hair at the back of my neck, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his lips to mine, his arms tightening around me... the world around us disappears for a moment until with a soft sigh, he breaks the kiss...#I gaze into his wide eyes for a moment, then smile before scrambling to my feet and offering my hand.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.flirt.male.first": "Sam's fingers tangle in the hair at the back of my neck, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his lips to mine, his arms tightening around me... the world around us disappears for a moment until with a soft sigh, he breaks the kiss...#I quickly get to my feet and offer my hand.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.flirt.neutral.first": "Sam's fingers tangle in the hair at the back of my neck, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his lips to mine, his arms tightening around me... the world around us disappears for a moment until with a soft sigh, he breaks the kiss...#I quickly get to my feet and offer my hand.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.flirt.female.third": "Sam tangles his fingers in {{farmerName}}'s hair, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his lips to hers... until with a soft sigh, he breaks the kiss...#she quickly gets to her feet and offers Sam a hand up.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.flirt.male.third": "Sam tangles his fingers in {{farmerName}}'s hair, his eyes flickering closed as he presses their lips together... until with a soft sigh, he breaks the kiss...#{{farmerName}} quickly gets to his feet and offers Sam a hand up.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.flirt.neutral.third": "Sam tangles his fingers in {{farmerName}}'s hair, his eyes flickering closed as he presses their lips together... until with a soft sigh, he breaks the kiss...#{{farmerName}} quickly gets to their feet and offers Sam a hand up.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.sassy.female.first": "Sam's fingers tangle in the hair at the back of my neck, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his lips to mine, his arms tightening around me... the world around us disappears for a moment until with a soft sigh, he breaks the kiss...#I gaze into his wide eyes for a moment, then caress his cheek before scrambling to my feet and offering my hand.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.sassy.male.first": "Sam's fingers tangle in the hair at the back of my neck, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his lips to mine, his arms tightening around me... the world around us disappears for a moment until with a soft sigh, he breaks the kiss...#I caress his cheek before scrambling to my feet and offering my hand.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.sassy.neutral.first": "Sam's fingers tangle in the hair at the back of my neck, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his lips to mine, his arms tightening around me... the world around us disappears for a moment until with a soft sigh, he breaks the kiss...#I caress his cheek before scrambling to my feet and offering my hand.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.sassy.female.third": "Sam tangles his fingers in {{farmerName}}'s hair, his eyes flickering closed as he presses his lips to hers... until with a soft sigh, he breaks the kiss...#she caresses his cheek before scrambling to her feet and offering Sam a hand up.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.sassy.male.third": "Sam tangles his fingers in {{farmerName}}'s hair, his eyes flickering closed as he presses their lips together... until with a soft sigh, he breaks the kiss...#{{farmerName}} caresses his cheek before scrambling to her feet and offering Sam a hand up.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.8.sassy.neutral.third": "Sam tangles his fingers in {{farmerName}}'s hair, his eyes flickering closed as he presses their lips together... until with a soft sigh, he breaks the kiss...#{{farmerName}} caresses his cheek before scrambling to her feet and offering Sam a hand up.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.9.1": "Heh... thanks for the hand up! Well, before I completely bowled you over, I was gonna ask if you were coming to the saloon tonight.$l#$b#I’ve been practicing my pool shots and I kinda wanted to show you.$10#$b#... You are? Awesome! I’ll see you there.$h#$b#...$l",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.9.2.shy": "Heh... ahem. Well, before I completely bowled you over, I was gonna ask if you were coming to the saloon tonight.$l#$b#I’ve been practicing my pool shots and I kinda wanted to show you.$10#$b#... You are? Awesome! I’ll see you there.$h#$b#Maybe... I could show you how to do the shot...?$l",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.9.2.flirt": "Heh... um... wow that was... ahem. Well, before I completely bowled you over, I was gonna ask if you were coming to the saloon tonight.$l#$b#I’ve been practicing my pool shots and I kinda wanted to show you.$10#$b#... You are? Awesome! I’ll see you there.$h#$b#Maybe... I could show you how to do the shot...?$l",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.9.2.sassy": "Wow that was... incredible... Damn... I uh...$l#$b#Ahem... Well, before I completely bowled you over, I was gonna ask if you were coming to the saloon tonight.$l#$b#I’ve been practicing my pool shots and I kinda wanted to show you.$10#$b#... You are? Awesome! I’ll see you there.$h#$b#Maybe... I could show you how to do the shot...?$l",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.10.1.first": "I close my eyes and all I see is Sam's face framed by fall leaves...",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.10.1.third": "Another crash landing... on top of Sam... he does have the strangest luck.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.10.2.shy.first": "I close my eyes and all I see is Sam's face framed by fall leaves... Sam teaching me a pool shot might be fun...",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.10.2.flirt.first": "I close my eyes and all I see is Sam's face framed by fall leaves... hmmm Sam teaching me a pool shot... I'll take that offer!",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.10.2.sassy.first": "I close my eyes and all I see is Sam's face framed by fall leaves...#Hmmm Sam teaching me a pool shot, bending over the table... I'll take that view... ahem!",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.10.2.shy.third": "Another crash landing... on top of Sam... he does have the strangest luck. That offer of a pool lesson sounds fun.",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.10.2.flirt.third": "Another crash landing... on top of Sam... he does have the strangest luck. That offer of a pool lesson sounds great!",
		"sam.event.Wipeout.10.2.sassy.third": "Another crash landing... on top of Sam... he does have the strangest luck.#That offer of a pool lesson... Sam bending over the table... would be a nice view... ahem!",
