	//Personal Space
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.1": "Hey @! Come on in, you look amazing...$l",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.2": "Hey...",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.3.Lover": "You know, for all my goofing around and flirting, I was always afraid you wouldn't like me.$10#$b#But hot damn, have you proved I was worried about nothing.$l",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.3.NoLover": "You know, for all my goofing around and flirting, I was always afraid you wouldn't like me.$10",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.4.Lover": "Ugh... You know you have your own room, right? Gross, keep that to yourself.$s",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.4.NoLover": "Ugh... You know you have your own room, right?$s",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.5": "I guess I really care about strong relationships and I hadn’t found the right person until I met you, and now I know I made the right choice.",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.6": "Remember when we met?#$b#... Yeah, I guess it was pretty memorable to be run over by a stranger on a skateboard. Of course I didn’t know what you were like at all but DAMN!#$b#Opening my eyes and seeing your face, and you were lying on top of me... I couldn’t think about anything else for days!$l#$b#You have this aura about you I couldn’t resist, more than just looks, though you're frickin' hot!$h#$b#And wow... I'd never felt anything like that in my- uh... probably shouldn't say that out loud.$10",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.7": "Oh Yoba, kill me now...",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.8": "Then when we became friends and really got to know each other, I TOTALLY fell for you, like crash and burn. Just ask Seb, haha!$h#$b#It was REALLY bad, he still makes sarcastic jokes about it.$s",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.9": "Tell me if I ever do or say anything you don’t like, I really want to do my best to make this work and I don’t want any misunderstandings between us.",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.10": "You could leave so I can work...$a",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.11": "I... I love you so much, @.$l",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.12.first": "I press my hand to Sam's chest, feeling the outline of his pecs rising and falling with his breath.#His heartbeat racing to match mine...",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.12.third": "{{farmerName}} presses a hand to Sam's chest, feeling the outline of his pecs rising and falling with his breath, his heartbeat racing...",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.13.Lover": "Look at that... there's bugs in my code AND in my room... horny bugs at that! Yoba, you better not replicate...$a",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.13.NoLover": "Look at that... there's bugs in my code AND in my room...$a",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.14": "Oh hey Seb, I forgot you were here!$10",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.15": "IT'S MY ROOM!!$a",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.16.Lover.first": "Sam can be oblivious, but he sure is a great kisser, among other things... Hello, other things...#OH! Poor Seb... I'll bring him a peace offering later.",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.16.NoLover.first": "Sam can be oblivious, but he sure is a great kisser...#OH! Poor Seb... I'll bring him a peace offering later.",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.16.Lover.third": "Sam can be oblivious, but he sure is a great kisser, among other things...#@ decides to bring Seb a peace offering later.",
		"sam.event.PersonalSpace.16.NoLover.third": "Sam can be oblivious, but he sure is a great kisser...#{{farmerName}} decides to bring Seb a peace offering later.",
		//followup
		"sebastian.eventSeen_MaggPersonalSpace11242025": "... Okay. I'm not mad at you, you can hang in my room whenever.#$b#I'm not really mad at Sam either, that's just how we are sometimes, he's oblivious and it can be annoying.$a#$b#But I don't really care if you two are in my room while I'm working, just try to keep Sam quiet.#$b#You know that bowl of saltwater taffy on my desk? That's the only thing I've found that shuts him up.$h#$b#Uh... try to keep the making out to a minimum, that just makes him a different kind of noisy... Eeesh...$s",

	//Under Cover
		"sam.event.vanilla10.1": "Hi @.#$b#I wanted to talk to you in private...",
		"sam.event.vanilla10.2": "It's kinda cold out here though... let's sneak into my room.$u#$b#Sorry, Mom doesn't like company here late so let's try not to bother her.",
		"sam.event.vanilla10.3": "So... @.$10#$b#We've been together for a little while now, and I gotta say, I've never been happier than I am now!$l#$b#Um... Er... What I really want to say is...$8#$b#@... you know how I feel about you, you're everything to me.$l",
		"sam.event.vanilla10.4.Lover": "Ever since we made love, I don't want to leave at night... I want to stay with you, y'know, together.$10",
		"sam.event.vanilla10.4.NoLover": "Every time we're together, I want to be closer to you... like, you know, like REALLY be togeth-$10",
		"sam.event.vanilla10.5": "Sam? I'm coming in!",
		"sam.event.vanilla10.6": "Quick! Hide in the bed!$8",
		"sam.event.vanilla10.6.2.first": "Sam's bed is covered in random clothes, blankets, and other stuff so it's easy to hide.#It smells nice, like outdoors with a touch of aftershave, like Sam...#I peek down between the bed and the wall and see a graveyard of guitar picks and socks.#Wait... why am I hiding in Sam's bed? Oh well...",
