		"sam.event.natural.4": "Aww look! It's a squirrel... oh and a rabbit! Huh, they must smell food and want a bite. Sorry guys, no marshmallows for you.$h",
		"sam.event.natural.5": "The night sounds sure are peaceful...",
		"sam.event.natural.6": "How about some music by the fire?",
