		//music
		"sam.event.natural.8": "Oh yeah, I brought my guitar of course, let's see... how about this... I'll just start playing and see where the music takes me.",
		"sam.event.natural.9": "Sam strums a few chords, humming along until the tune takes off. His fingers stroke the strings, the notes taking flight... swirling about among the leaves and branches, weaving a melody that seems to come from the forest itself.",
		"sam.event.natural.10.first": "Eventually, the notes fade away and Sam sets the guitar aside. I snuggle up to him, and he wraps his arms around me, stroking my hair.",
		"sam.event.natural.10.third": "Eventually, the notes fade away and Sam sets the guitar aside. {{farmerName}} snuggles into his arms.",
		"sam.event.natural.11": "Mmmm this is perfect, being out here together... let's lie here and look at the stars for a while before turning in.$l",
		"sam.event.natural.12": "@... can we... what if we make love under the stars?$l",
