		"sam.event.natural.16": "Nghhh... OH GOD... don't stop... @...$l",
		"sam.event.natural.17.first": "The gentle breeze and peaceful insect chorus wrap around us in the green of the forest... there is only me and Sam... lost in the rush of passion and emotion.",
		"sam.event.natural.17.third": "The gentle breeze and peaceful insect chorus wrap around us in the green of the forest... there is only {{farmerName}} and Sam... lost in the rush of passion and emotion.",
