		"sam.event.Homemade.30.1.third": "After dozing for a little while, Sam's stomach makes itself known...",
		"sam.event.Homemade.30.2": "Oh... um... Do you want to eat? I do have some food for us.$10",
		//option2 Picnic
		"sam.event.Homemade.31": "First, I just wanted to say... I can't promise I'll never screw up again, but I'll always be open and honest with you, no matter what.$7#$b#If you ever wonder what I'm thinking or doing, ask me and I'll tell you everything.$7#$b#Except maybe what I got you for your birthday...$10",
		"sam.event.Homemade.32": "Over there, I set a picnic up for us.",
		"sam.event.Homemade.33": "It's not a fancy dinner, but after... you know... I wanted to make everything myself.$h",
		"sam.event.Homemade.34": "Mom helped me a little with the baked fish fillets, it took me three tries to not totally torch them...#$b#I finally got it right and they have a really great spice blend Alex taught me.$h#$b#Did you know Alex is a pretty great cook?",
		"sam.event.Homemade.35": "... And this is a fresh salad, don't worry, I didn't forage the greens myself, I wouldn't be able to tell the different plants apart.$10#$b#Leah brought a lot of extra greens to the saloon so Gus was handing them out. Luckily that was just wash and chop.$h#$b#There's chocolate mochi for dessert... I didn't actually make those, I got them from Gus.#$b#And some Joja colas to drink.", //SamWorry
		"sam.event.Homemade.36": "Erm... It's not what I was imagining, but I hope you like it.$l#$b#I know I'm loud, and like to goof around, and I definitely make mistakes sometimes...$s#$b#Thanks for sticking with me.$l",
		"sam.event.Homemade.37.first": "The picnic is delicious! Sam did a great job... I take his hands and he grips my fingers tight... his unrestrained grin lighting up his eyes.",
		"sam.event.Homemade.37.third": "The picnic is delicious! Sam did a great job... {{farmerName}} takes his hands and he holds on tight... his unrestrained grin lighting up his eyes.",

