	//Strike a Chord
		"sam.event.StrikeChord.1": "Hi! Everyone else left to visit my grandparents overnight, I stayed home this time to work on some videos and stuff.#$b#Vince decided to try out my guitar and messed with some of the tuning pegs so I’m just getting it fixed up.#$b#Come here, I’ll show you a few chords.",
