		"sam.event.StrikeChord.2.1": "C'mere so I can reach around you...",
		"sam.event.StrikeChord.3": "Okay hold the guitar like this, put this hand over the body and hold the neck here.#$b#Now press down the top and bottom strings, then this one.#$b#Okay, now strum the pick over the strings. Not too hard...#$b#Great! That’s a G chord.$h",
		"sam.event.StrikeChord.4.first": "Sam's breath tickles my neck, he feels warm... I relax against his chest and feel his lips on my ear.",
