	//Magnifying Glass followup
		"abigail.MaggMagnifyingGlassTopic": "So are you writing your own vows for the ceremony?#$b#Hmmm better make sure Sam isn't making any dumb skating analogies.$h#$b#It would be hilarious if he had a sneezing fit right in the middle of the thing! Oh okay, not really, but just sayin'.$h#$b#You ready for hyper lover boy to be permanently velcroed to your side?#$b#Because you know he will be, he's a master-level clinger for sure!$h#$b#You must be ok with that since you're still together, ha!#$e#And you'll have access to his ass whenever you want... bet you're looking forward to that, haha!$h",

	//It's Time
		"sam.event.itstime.1": "Hey, um... Sam asked me to give you this.",
		"sam.event.itstime.2.first": "Seb hands me a guitar pick, on one side is a drawing of a bandage and the other side a frowny face.",
		"sam.event.itstime.2.third": "Seb hands {{farmerName}} a guitar pick, on one side is a drawing of a bandage and the other side a frowny face.",
		"sam.event.itstime.3": "It's like a clue or something. Hey, don't look at me, Sam came up with this game all on his own.$h",
		"sam.event.itstime.4": "Don't forget to come by later, it's Solarion Chronicles night and we'll definitely need your help for the next scenario.$7",
		"sam.event.itstime.5": "If it's a clue, it must mean the clinic. Maybe Harvey knows what's up.",
		"sam.event.itstime.6": "Good morning, @! You look well.$h#$b#Oh yes, Sam asked me to give you something... hmm where did I put that?$s",
		"sam.event.itstime.7": "Oh here it is, in my coat pocket.#$b#I have no idea what this means, but he said you would know.$h",
		"sam.event.itstime.8": "Another guitar pick, this one has a football on one side and a barbell on the other. Well, that's easy!",
		"sam.event.itstime.9": "It was good to see you!",
		"sam.event.itstime.10": "Yo, what's up? Glad you caught me, I'm supposed to give you this.",
		"sam.event.itstime.11": "This pick has a drawing of a castle and a... bug? Hmm.#Castle would be the beach, but a bug... must be Vincent.",
		"sam.event.itstime.12": "Sam was even more wound up than usual when he came by with this, he's definitely got something planned.#$b#Good luck, see ya around!$h",
		"sam.event.itstime.13": "Sam put a decent amount of thought into this game, it must be something interesting at least...",
		"sam.event.itstime.14": "{{VinceName}}! Haha! I got something for you!#$b#Sam will be happy I didn't lose it, I almost lost it once, but found it again so here!$h",
		"sam.event.itstime.15": "Sam's super excited today, I asked him what he's doing, but he wouldn't tell.#$b#He said it's a secret. If you find out, you'll tell me, right?",
		"sam.event.itstime.16.first": "Vincent's guitar pick is a little sticky, but I can see a heart on one side and the other has a crab.#A crab could mean Elliott's place, but the heart... probably the tide pools where we had the picnic.",
		"sam.event.itstime.16.third": "Vincent's guitar pick is a little sticky, but {{farmerName}} can see a heart on one side and the other has a crab.#A crab could mean Elliott's place, but the heart... probably the tide pools where we had the picnic.",
		"sam.event.itstime.17": "Woah... what is going on here??#Sam is looking out over the water...idly strumming his guitar.",
		"sam.event.itstime.18.first": "He turns and grins, my heart leaps into my throat...",
		"sam.event.itstime.18.third": "He turns and grins, {{farmerName}}'s heart skips a beat...",
		"sam.event.itstime.19": "@! You're here!$h#$b#Phew, I was afraid Vince might lose his clue or Alex would flake on me!#$b#Um, well... obviously this isn't about Vince or Alex... or guitar picks...$l#$b#I asked Seb, Luca, and his friend there, Killian, to help me out... Don't worry, the flowers are some kind of magic? I dunno, Killian did all that stuff.$10#$b#So first, I wrote this song... um... yeah.$l",
		"sam.event.itstime.20": "Listen, @, you know how I feel about you.#$b#When I'm with you, I'm happy, and I miss you like crazy when you're not there.#$b#I want to wake up next to you every morning, play music with you...#$b#... snuggle up together in the evenings... sing you to sleep.$l",
		"sam.event.itstime.21": "Okay. Here goes... {{farmerName}}... Will you marry me?",
		"sam.event.itstime.22": "YES! Jump into Sam's arms...",
		"sam.event.itstime.23": "This is... so sudden. I'm not ready yet.",
		"sam.event.itstime.24.female.first": "I take Sam's face in my hands, gazing into those brilliant pools of aquamarine...#I love you, Sam... tears well up in my eyes, threatening to spill over...",
		"sam.event.itstime.24.male.first": "I take Sam's face in my hands, gazing into those brilliant pools of aquamarine...#I love you, Sam... I want to be with you.",
		"sam.event.itstime.24.neutral.first": "I take Sam's face in my hands, gazing into those brilliant pools of aquamarine...#I love you, Sam... I want to be with you.",
		"sam.event.itstime.24.female.third": "{{farmerName}} takes Sam's face in her hands, gazing into those brilliant pools of aquamarine...#'I love you, Sam...' tears well up in her eyes, threatening to spill over...",
		"sam.event.itstime.24.male.third": "{{farmerName}} takes Sam's face in his hands, gazing into those brilliant pools of aquamarine...#'I love you, Sam... ... I want to be with you.'",
