		"sam.event.morning.winter.married.4": "There's a lot of snow out there, won't be any skating going on for a while.$s#$b#When you're done with chores, want to go skiing? Or we can have a snowball fight... make snow angels... make out in the snow...#$b#Maybe not sex in the snow, but we could come back inside and thaw each other out.$l",
		"sam.event.morning.winter.married.5": "It's really cold, get in my shirt with me... Mmmm that's better.$l",
		"sam.event.morning.winter.married.6": "Wow, that's a lot of layers! Probably smart though, I just took a shower and now I have icicles in my hair.$s#$b#Here, get inside this towel with me...$l",
		"sam.event.morning.winter.married.7": "'Morning @, I cleaned up some random stuff around here, sorry I'm kind of a slob sometimes.#$b#I wish you could stay here with me, it feels like a hibernation kind of day... you know, hibernate under a pile of blankets and massage each other until we--$l",
		"sam.event.morning.winter.married.8": "I was making coffee and looking out the window, the snowflakes drifting around the porch lights are really sparkling.[253]#$b#C'mere, lemme show you.$l",
		"sam.event.morning.winter.married.9": "Today might be a good day for a Seb ambush, what do you think? I would say it's not fair to gang up on him, but it kind of is, ha!#$b#Oh, we could have a snowball war with him and Alex.$h#$b#After we demolish the two of them, we can celebrate our victory here by the fire, I'll really warm you up.$l",
		"sam.event.morning.winter.married.10": "Ooof... I let %pet out and got a freezing gust of wind in the face.$s#$b#C'mere, @, I need to snuggle up with you.$l",
		//middle
		"sam.event.morning.married.11": "I have a couple new songs rattling around in my head, I'm going to get them written down today.",
		"sam.event.morning.married.12": "Are you going out mining today? I'll be sure to have my massaging hands ready for when you get back.$l",
		"sam.event.morning.married.13": "I think I'll clean up my skateboard today, replace some parts that are worn out now that we have some extra cash.",
		"sam.event.morning.married.14": "I'll be working on some tunes today, I might ask Seb over to help out. I'll take some breaks to check on things around here too.",
		"sam.event.morning.married.15": "All the exercise I get around here is really keeping me in shape, but I'll probably take a couple hours and hit the gym with Alex and Seb.",
		"sam.event.morning.married.16": "I think I'll record a couple songs today, then take Vince out for a while. I'm sure Mom would love to have some peace for a couple hours.",
		"sam.event.morning.married.17": "How are the fences and buildings holding up? Tell me if we need anything upgraded or fixed, I can let Robin know when I go visit Seb.",
		"sam.event.morning.married.18": "We're always busy but I'm glad you make time for us every day. It's important to me that we do things together and stay close.$l",
		"sam.event.morning.married.19": "I kind of wonder if I don't say it enough, but I love you and I don't wanna be anywhere but here with you.$l",
		"sam.event.morning.married.20": "Maybe after work we could head up to the bathhouse and unwind for a while, I promise I won't do anything wild and fall in. I mean, I'll really try not to do that.$l",
		//message
